WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:37.969 --> 00:01:38.970
Will you marry me?


00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.528
Kabir... please.


00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:42.006
Okay.


00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:44.536
Will you marry me, please?


00:01:45.844 --> 00:01:47.004
Why are you doing this?


00:01:47.745 --> 00:01:49.645
Because sooner or later we will.


00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:52.280
We love each other.


00:01:52.984 --> 00:01:55.282
Our families seem to tolerate each other.


00:01:56.321 --> 00:01:59.290
l'm an architect and
you're an interior designer.


00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:01.149
We're perfect.


00:02:04.462 --> 00:02:05.520
What do you say?


00:02:07.065 --> 00:02:08.089
Are you sure?


00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:10.892
Natasha, please make it quick...


00:02:10.969 --> 00:02:11.697
my knee is hurting.


00:02:13.805 --> 00:02:14.772
Yes!


00:02:32.724 --> 00:02:37.354
lt seems like only yesterday
that Natasha came into this world.


00:02:37.795 --> 00:02:39.126
And today she's getting engaged.


00:02:40.698 --> 00:02:42.723
Kabir, l'm not losing a daughter.


00:02:43.801 --> 00:02:45.325
l'm gaining a son.


00:02:45.904 --> 00:02:47.132
You're so filmy, dad.


00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:52.567
Harryji


00:02:54.746 --> 00:02:58.045
Two years ago you commissioned me
to build your hotel.


00:02:59.017 --> 00:03:01.747
Who would've imagined that
one day we'll be a big family.


00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.280
On behalf of my family,
l welcome you all.


00:03:05.723 --> 00:03:06.587
Thank you so much.


00:03:07.225 --> 00:03:10.626
Did you ever know that you're my hero


00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.090
You're everything l wish l could be


00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:19.564
l can fly like an eagle


00:03:20.071 --> 00:03:25.099
Cause you're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:26.411 --> 00:03:32.281
You're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:37.021 --> 00:03:38.147
- That was lovely.


00:03:43.661 --> 00:03:44.529
Hello everyone.


00:03:44.529 --> 00:03:45.689
l am lmran.


00:03:46.464 --> 00:03:47.988
Kabir and l have been friends
since school.


00:03:48.199 --> 00:03:49.427
The three Musketeers!


00:03:49.701 --> 00:03:52.602
That's right, it was the name
uncle had given the three of us.


00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.837
The three Musketeers.


00:03:54.672 --> 00:03:56.908
Unfortunately, the third musketeer...


00:03:56.908 --> 00:03:59.103
Arjun is not with us anymore.


00:04:00.812 --> 00:04:03.804
Don't worry, he's alive.
He just isn't here right now.


00:04:05.984 --> 00:04:07.008
Anyway, Natasha...


00:04:07.285 --> 00:04:09.913
Kabir is one of the nicest guys ever.


00:04:11.055 --> 00:04:13.523
So, if you ever smash his BMW,
don't worry.


00:04:14.826 --> 00:04:15.850
Good excuse to get a new car.


00:04:17.295 --> 00:04:19.763
He's also very intelligent.


00:04:21.232 --> 00:04:23.257
So leave the kid's homework to him.


00:04:23.735 --> 00:04:25.069
You're a true friend, thanks.


00:04:25.069 --> 00:04:26.036
You're welcome, bro.


00:04:27.005 --> 00:04:28.870
He's very large hearted.


00:04:29.507 --> 00:04:31.376
So, don't think twice...


00:04:31.376 --> 00:04:33.003
just buy those diamonds.


00:04:39.484 --> 00:04:40.678
Basically Natasha...


00:04:41.286 --> 00:04:43.311
Kabir is a solid guy.


00:04:44.322 --> 00:04:46.722
Put your hand in his and
walk with him.


00:04:47.959 --> 00:04:49.449
Because no matter what...


00:04:49.694 --> 00:04:50.820
he will never let you down.


00:04:51.796 --> 00:04:53.286
- So sweet.
- Hear, hear!


00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:56.800
Thank you.


00:04:57.068 --> 00:04:57.966
You can send the cheque now.


00:05:00.071 --> 00:05:00.765
Tanya...


00:05:01.906 --> 00:05:02.770
thank you.


00:05:03.741 --> 00:05:05.140
Let me warn you...


00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.710
Nikhil is planning a
full power bachelor party.


00:05:08.146 --> 00:05:09.013
Too late.


00:05:09.013 --> 00:05:11.709
His school friends have planned
a bachelor holiday.


00:05:12.016 --> 00:05:13.005
A road trip...


00:05:13.217 --> 00:05:14.047
through Spain.


00:05:14.485 --> 00:05:16.350
-A road trip?
- Don't ask.


00:05:16.788 --> 00:05:19.290
They had made some pact
in college that...


00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.360
each one would choose
an adventure sport...


00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.385
Are you serious?
Like Fear Factor?.


00:05:24.896 --> 00:05:25.885
Exactly!


00:05:25.963 --> 00:05:28.454
And the other two would have to do it.


00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.394
So, what have you picked?


00:05:31.002 --> 00:05:32.367
That l can't say.


00:05:33.538 --> 00:05:34.937
Not in front of me, at least.


00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.138
You see...


00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:40.439
the sport we pick
is a surprise for the other two.


00:05:40.912 --> 00:05:41.901
Shut up!


00:05:42.146 --> 00:05:43.511
- Seriously.
- Are you kidding me?


00:05:43.881 --> 00:05:44.870
No.


00:05:45.183 --> 00:05:48.050
That ensures none of us back out.


00:05:49.053 --> 00:05:50.543
Whose idea was this?


00:05:51.055 --> 00:05:51.714
Mine.


00:05:52.457 --> 00:05:53.151
Three weeks.


00:05:53.358 --> 00:05:54.689
You know how these boys are.


00:05:55.226 --> 00:05:55.749
Not Kabir.


00:05:56.561 --> 00:05:57.721
Oh please!


00:05:58.062 --> 00:06:00.622
All guys go crazy at bachelor parties.


00:06:01.733 --> 00:06:02.927
ln fact...


00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:07.733
Nikhil still hasn't told me
what happened at his.


00:06:09.173 --> 00:06:10.037
l don't know.


00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:13.435
l heard something about
your bachelor party.


00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:19.914
Who told you?


00:06:20.184 --> 00:06:21.151
So it is true.


00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:23.051
Does Natasha know?


00:06:24.055 --> 00:06:25.249
No man, why would l tell her?


00:06:25.556 --> 00:06:27.046
Please... don't tell her.


00:06:28.793 --> 00:06:29.782
She was from Ukraine.


00:06:31.229 --> 00:06:32.560
- Bloody hot!
- Nice.


00:06:32.964 --> 00:06:33.828
l was sloshed.


00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.424
Okay, listen...


00:06:36.801 --> 00:06:39.292
lf Sameera finds out about this,
she'll kill me.


00:06:39.871 --> 00:06:41.270
l know, don't worry.


00:06:41.339 --> 00:06:44.509
lt was my last night as a bachelor.
You know l'd never do it otherwise.


00:06:44.509 --> 00:06:46.544
l understand, don't worry about it.


00:06:46.544 --> 00:06:47.533
- Please.
- lt happens.


00:06:49.147 --> 00:06:50.114
Sameera!


00:06:53.618 --> 00:06:54.676
Sorry, l couldn't resist.


00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.385
- Take care, man.
- See you.


00:07:00.358 --> 00:07:03.156
Trust me, this trick never fails.


00:07:03.628 --> 00:07:05.229
What do you mean?


00:07:05.229 --> 00:07:09.757
Well, you tell people you know
something about them...


00:07:09.834 --> 00:07:13.037
and before you know it,
they tell you their secrets.


00:07:13.037 --> 00:07:14.372
Shut up!


00:07:14.372 --> 00:07:16.567
You didn't know about the Ukrainian?


00:07:16.974 --> 00:07:18.339
No, he just told me.


00:07:19.677 --> 00:07:21.338
Mind blowing!


00:07:23.681 --> 00:07:26.514
- Yeah, well time equals money, Simon.
You want money, stop wasting my time.


00:07:27.218 --> 00:07:29.118
Sell 50,000 June contracts!


00:07:29.187 --> 00:07:31.417
50,000 and don't screw up
my stop losses this time!


00:07:32.623 --> 00:07:33.453
How much?


00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:35.990
Damn! That's horrendous!


00:07:36.661 --> 00:07:37.958
Sell it. Sell everything.


00:07:45.636 --> 00:07:47.839
Listen Joe, if you continue to give me
bullshit fills like that...


00:07:47.839 --> 00:07:49.966
l'm going to have to trade
my Ferrari in for a Ford Fiesta!


00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:55.171
We have white and gold and...


00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.908
tonnes of champagne.


00:07:57.415 --> 00:07:58.245
And...


00:07:59.317 --> 00:08:00.545
- the centre peice.
- This is nice.


00:08:01.519 --> 00:08:02.417
Finally!


00:08:02.987 --> 00:08:03.681
Kabira!


00:08:04.155 --> 00:08:05.713
Sorry man.


00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.519
You have no idea what's happening here.


00:08:07.692 --> 00:08:09.853
And you have no idea
what a nice party you missed.


00:08:10.795 --> 00:08:12.023
l'm sure, man.


00:08:12.497 --> 00:08:13.521
Listen...


00:08:13.998 --> 00:08:15.226
l've a problem.


00:08:15.967 --> 00:08:17.502
l can't make it to Spain.


00:08:17.502 --> 00:08:18.025
- What?!


00:08:19.303 --> 00:08:20.805
Arjun, you promised!


00:08:20.805 --> 00:08:22.573
l know but...


00:08:22.573 --> 00:08:25.599
l thought this deal l'm working on
would come through...


00:08:25.743 --> 00:08:26.402
- but l'm stuck.


00:08:27.011 --> 00:08:29.809
l can't believe you're ditching me
on my bachelor trip.


00:08:30.815 --> 00:08:32.116
lt's not that...


00:08:32.116 --> 00:08:33.481
- Then what is it?


00:08:33.718 --> 00:08:36.209
We had decided to do this together.


00:08:37.989 --> 00:08:40.355
lf you can't make it,
l'm calling it off.


00:08:40.691 --> 00:08:42.921
Don't get sentimental.
lt's my work!


00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.695
l'm not.


00:08:44.695 --> 00:08:47.565
lt's been cancelled once before,
so let's do it again.


00:08:47.565 --> 00:08:48.862
lt's fine.


00:08:50.234 --> 00:08:53.692
lt's either the three of us going
or none at all.


00:09:17.795 --> 00:09:18.853
Hey...


00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:20.558
Hi.


00:09:20.798 --> 00:09:21.457
How are you?


00:09:21.966 --> 00:09:22.830
Good.


00:09:24.235 --> 00:09:26.203
Looking good,
you've been working out?


00:09:26.737 --> 00:09:27.294
Yes.


00:09:27.838 --> 00:09:29.328
l usually come in the morning.


00:09:34.645 --> 00:09:36.476
l was going to call you.


00:09:37.381 --> 00:09:38.370
Then why didn't you?


00:09:39.951 --> 00:09:41.316
l'm getting married.


00:09:45.523 --> 00:09:48.048
-That was quick.
- Arjun, please!


00:09:52.964 --> 00:09:54.295
All the best, Rohini.


00:10:11.882 --> 00:10:13.816
- Arjun, it's me again.


00:10:14.318 --> 00:10:16.220
- Don't ditch me.


00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.711
- l know why you're making excuses.


00:10:19.357 --> 00:10:21.359
- But it's been four years
for that incident.


00:10:21.359 --> 00:10:22.348
- l'm getting married now.


00:10:23.361 --> 00:10:25.556
- Even today, l only have two friends.


00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:29.829
- We're the three Musketeers.
All for one, one for all.


00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.598
Have you thought about...


00:10:38.843 --> 00:10:39.867
what we spoke?


00:10:40.678 --> 00:10:41.303
About what?


00:10:42.913 --> 00:10:46.041
Are you moving back to Bombay?


00:10:46.651 --> 00:10:47.640
Ammi...


00:10:48.486 --> 00:10:51.455
l like Delhi and living on my own.


00:10:58.162 --> 00:11:01.065
And this trip to Spain...


00:11:01.065 --> 00:11:03.727
is it a coincidence or
did you plan it?


00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.370
Why don't you just say
what you're really thinking?


00:11:09.874 --> 00:11:10.841
Fine.


00:11:12.009 --> 00:11:13.636
Do you intend to meet Salman?


00:11:14.912 --> 00:11:16.414
l don't know.


00:11:16.414 --> 00:11:18.439
lmran, why don't you trust me?


00:11:19.116 --> 00:11:20.851
lt's not about you Ammi.


00:11:20.851 --> 00:11:23.220
- He is my father.
- He's your father?


00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:28.385
Has he ever called you
or tried to find out how you are?


00:11:28.459 --> 00:11:30.450
Maybe he did and
you kept it from me.


00:11:31.962 --> 00:11:34.328
Until recently l wasn't even aware
that he is my father.


00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:36.724
Alright.


00:11:36.967 --> 00:11:38.469
Do what you want.


00:11:38.469 --> 00:11:41.005
But please remember this.


00:11:41.005 --> 00:11:43.030
Faisal was your only father.


00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.207
- Hello there.
- Hello.


00:11:51.649 --> 00:11:52.983
l can see you.


00:11:52.983 --> 00:11:55.152
l miss you, baby.


00:11:55.152 --> 00:11:57.643
Now we can see each other everyday.


00:11:57.888 --> 00:12:00.356
l'm only going for
three weeks, Natasha.


00:12:09.133 --> 00:12:11.431
What will l do in London all alone?


00:12:11.869 --> 00:12:14.071
You'll shop.


00:12:14.071 --> 00:12:18.269
And in three weeks l'll come to London
to carry your shopping bags.


00:12:18.342 --> 00:12:20.333
- Very funny.
- l know.


00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.369
- l don't see Madrid in this plan.
- Because it's not there.


00:16:05.369 --> 00:16:07.234
- We travel to Spain but
we're not going to see the capital?


00:16:07.304 --> 00:16:09.373
- We don't have enough time.


00:16:09.373 --> 00:16:11.068
- We can't change it now.
- l think we should.


00:16:11.141 --> 00:16:12.472
Look who's here!


00:16:13.811 --> 00:16:15.972
- Welcome! How was your flight?
- Hello.


00:16:17.014 --> 00:16:18.248
Well...


00:16:18.248 --> 00:16:19.442
it flew.


00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.044
Funny!


00:16:29.626 --> 00:16:32.196
- Good to see you.
- You too.


00:16:32.196 --> 00:16:33.254
l'm sorry about Abu.


00:16:34.131 --> 00:16:35.758
l got your email.


00:16:36.867 --> 00:16:38.562
- How's Ammi?
- She's fine.


00:16:39.136 --> 00:16:41.366
lt's not easy to get over these things.


00:16:42.806 --> 00:16:43.795
How've you been?


00:16:44.174 --> 00:16:45.072
l'm good.


00:16:45.142 --> 00:16:46.477
Pretty good actually.


00:16:46.477 --> 00:16:48.604
l've a new apartment.
Three bedrooms, big space.


00:16:49.346 --> 00:16:50.347
Nice.


00:16:50.347 --> 00:16:52.649
l can't believe we're together again.


00:16:52.649 --> 00:16:54.344
- Yeah.
- Finally!


00:16:54.718 --> 00:16:55.616
Should we sit?


00:16:56.653 --> 00:16:58.484
So, here is the plan.


00:16:58.989 --> 00:17:00.190
First...


00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:02.750
we go to Costa Brava,
which is my choice.


00:17:03.627 --> 00:17:05.356
Then Arjun wants to go to Seville.


00:17:05.996 --> 00:17:07.398
And then we'll head to...


00:17:07.398 --> 00:17:08.922
Pampalona which you've chosen.


00:17:08.999 --> 00:17:11.194
Tomorrow morning we leave for
Costa Brava.


00:17:17.741 --> 00:17:18.969
What are you doing with the laptop?


00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.878
l'm looking for an address.


00:17:20.878 --> 00:17:22.175
Hola Kabira.


00:17:25.549 --> 00:17:27.039
Kabira...


00:17:27.451 --> 00:17:28.509
Your treasure.


00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.415
Brilliant. Thanks a ton.


00:17:35.626 --> 00:17:37.287
What have you done to this?


00:17:37.694 --> 00:17:38.752
Dude!


00:17:38.829 --> 00:17:42.499
First of all, be thankful that
l bought this 12,000 Euro bag for you!


00:17:42.499 --> 00:17:43.397
What?


00:17:44.868 --> 00:17:45.527
Here... show, show...


00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.971
12,000 Euro for this purse?


00:17:52.476 --> 00:17:53.807
Way more than your salary.


00:17:57.214 --> 00:17:57.771
What?


00:17:58.949 --> 00:18:00.439
Natasha loves these bags.


00:18:00.884 --> 00:18:02.112
And l love cars, Kabir.


00:18:02.886 --> 00:18:04.080
Always remember.


00:18:04.154 --> 00:18:06.213
lf you ever want to gift
me an expensive car...


00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.958
don't hesitate.


00:18:07.958 --> 00:18:09.393
l won't.


00:18:09.393 --> 00:18:09.916
Good.


00:18:09.993 --> 00:18:10.994
Let's go.


00:18:10.994 --> 00:18:12.325
l can't.


00:18:13.063 --> 00:18:14.898
l need to make some calls.


00:18:14.898 --> 00:18:15.694
l'll see you guys later.


00:18:17.134 --> 00:18:18.499
Adios amigos.


00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.865
- l thought this was a holiday.
- Me too.


00:18:22.573 --> 00:18:24.234
Let's go.


00:18:24.508 --> 00:18:25.475
We take the next right.


00:18:29.646 --> 00:18:31.113
- Looks quite old.
- There it is.


00:18:35.052 --> 00:18:36.212
There is the cathedral.


00:18:37.554 --> 00:18:39.613
- Do you know where this place is?
- Yes, straight ahead.


00:18:40.023 --> 00:18:41.513
How far is this gallery?


00:18:42.359 --> 00:18:43.326
Shut up!


00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.957
lt's just here.


00:18:45.629 --> 00:18:48.029
This is the street.
Catonia... whatever.


00:18:50.067 --> 00:18:51.261
And that's the place.


00:18:51.335 --> 00:18:52.495
l guess.


00:19:04.314 --> 00:19:05.508
Hey!


00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.078
Salman Habib.


00:19:11.155 --> 00:19:12.349
lt's a desi name.


00:19:13.323 --> 00:19:15.052
He must be Pakistani or lndian.


00:19:30.807 --> 00:19:31.603
Thanks.


00:19:36.146 --> 00:19:37.648
l wish you'd come with us.


00:19:37.648 --> 00:19:39.809
We walked all over
looking for his gallery.


00:19:40.384 --> 00:19:42.113
Man, this city is beautiful.


00:19:42.186 --> 00:19:45.212
Well, today l made
a 2,000 Pound commission, so...


00:19:45.289 --> 00:19:46.654
excuse me if l don't complain.


00:19:47.391 --> 00:19:48.119
Cheers.


00:19:48.192 --> 00:19:49.659
- 2,000 Pounds?
- Yup!


00:19:50.027 --> 00:19:50.493
Cheers.


00:19:55.132 --> 00:19:56.099
Dude...


00:19:56.667 --> 00:19:57.998
l heard something about you.


00:19:59.203 --> 00:19:59.897
What?


00:20:02.206 --> 00:20:03.264
You know what it is.


00:20:05.209 --> 00:20:06.039
Mom told you?


00:20:08.912 --> 00:20:10.038
Yes.


00:20:11.882 --> 00:20:14.350
But did she tell you l was forced?


00:20:14.618 --> 00:20:16.176
- Okay?
- Okay.


00:20:17.621 --> 00:20:19.612
God man!
She can't keep anything to herself.


00:20:20.524 --> 00:20:21.718
She's driving me crazy, man.


00:20:22.459 --> 00:20:23.160
Yeah.


00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:24.828
She came to London a few days ago.


00:20:24.828 --> 00:20:26.997
And dragged me to
some friend's relative's place.


00:20:26.997 --> 00:20:27.827
To see a girl.


00:20:28.699 --> 00:20:31.429
Neelu aunty and
Gogi uncle's daughter Cookie.


00:20:31.802 --> 00:20:34.635
l'd decided that l'd go,
have some tea...


00:20:34.838 --> 00:20:37.705
exchange pleasantries and
decline the match.


00:20:39.042 --> 00:20:41.044
As l took the first sip...


00:20:41.044 --> 00:20:42.272
Cookie said 'no'!


00:20:42.813 --> 00:20:43.837
So... you know...


00:20:44.481 --> 00:20:45.182
What?!


00:20:45.182 --> 00:20:46.843
l mean, so what!
What is there?


00:20:52.289 --> 00:20:52.983
What?


00:20:55.792 --> 00:20:57.259
Come on, man!


00:20:58.528 --> 00:21:00.758
You were set up for
an arranged marriage...


00:21:00.831 --> 00:21:02.065
and you got rejected?


00:21:02.065 --> 00:21:04.397
But l didn't even try
to create an impression.


00:21:04.468 --> 00:21:06.336
- Now you're just saying it.
- l didn't want to impress her!


00:21:06.336 --> 00:21:07.667
You've ruined our reputation.


00:21:08.205 --> 00:21:10.571
Shut up, please stop it!


00:21:11.675 --> 00:21:14.303
Why did she have to tell you?
What's wrong with her?


00:21:15.178 --> 00:21:17.514
Actually, your mom said nothing.


00:21:17.514 --> 00:21:20.984
lt's his latest trick.
And you're his latest victim.


00:21:20.984 --> 00:21:22.008
- Cheers!


00:21:22.886 --> 00:21:23.944
2,000 Pounds!


00:21:27.724 --> 00:21:29.954
Grow up, man!


00:21:31.295 --> 00:21:32.694
How old are you?


00:21:34.698 --> 00:21:35.255
You know what...


00:21:35.666 --> 00:21:37.234
we have to have some shots.


00:21:37.234 --> 00:21:39.566
- One for Cookie.
- We'll raise a toast to Cookie.


00:21:39.636 --> 00:21:40.694
Okay.


00:21:42.506 --> 00:21:44.174
Not for me.


00:21:44.174 --> 00:21:45.664
l have a conference call
in an hour.


00:21:46.076 --> 00:21:47.634
Same old plan?


00:21:47.711 --> 00:21:49.338
Mint money and retire at 40?


00:21:49.713 --> 00:21:50.737
Yup!


00:21:50.814 --> 00:21:51.712
That's the plan.


00:22:02.392 --> 00:22:04.227
Listen...


00:22:04.227 --> 00:22:05.251
thank you.


00:22:05.962 --> 00:22:06.929
For what?


00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:09.755
For coming on this trip.
lt means a lot to me.


00:22:12.235 --> 00:22:13.862
l'm sure it does.


00:22:21.478 --> 00:22:23.013
Literacy is the key.


00:22:23.013 --> 00:22:24.640
lt's not that simple.


00:22:25.482 --> 00:22:28.451
Oh - my - God!


00:22:33.857 --> 00:22:36.985
Kabira, amazing choice.


00:22:37.361 --> 00:22:39.921
She's gorgeous but she isn't ours.


00:22:40.997 --> 00:22:41.986
What?


00:22:42.632 --> 00:22:44.190
An SUV will be a lot comfortable.


00:22:44.968 --> 00:22:47.698
To hell with the comfort.
Just look at her!


00:22:51.541 --> 00:22:52.735
Guys?


00:22:53.977 --> 00:22:56.747
- Hola, good morning.
Your name?


00:22:56.747 --> 00:22:57.714
- Kabir Dewan.
- Guys!


00:22:58.582 --> 00:23:00.277
Kabir... Arjun...


00:23:00.984 --> 00:23:02.178
She's beautiful.


00:23:05.322 --> 00:23:08.314
l've booked an SUV and
they've charged me, sorry.


00:23:09.059 --> 00:23:10.424
Sell Natasha's purse.


00:23:11.695 --> 00:23:12.662
Funny.


00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.524
Please!


00:23:15.031 --> 00:23:17.499
What are you doing?
Behave yourself!


00:23:19.636 --> 00:23:21.627
Oh, don't even
think about it, dude.


00:23:22.339 --> 00:23:24.807
All my life l sat in your car.


00:23:26.243 --> 00:23:27.642
Now it's my turn.


00:23:30.313 --> 00:23:32.215
What are you doing?


00:23:32.215 --> 00:23:34.615
12,000 Euro. She rides first class.


00:24:38.415 --> 00:24:41.213
Hey Sarah, what's up?
Mr. Yamamoto called?


00:24:43.053 --> 00:24:44.918
Well, he'll have
the docket in two days.


00:24:46.323 --> 00:24:49.554
No, no don't say l'm on a holiday.
Just get Joe to call me back. Bye.


00:24:55.499 --> 00:24:56.989
Hey Joe, what's up?


00:24:57.801 --> 00:24:59.359
Like... 'now' now?


00:25:01.204 --> 00:25:05.106
Yeah, okay.
Yeah, l'll do it, bye.


00:25:13.216 --> 00:25:14.410
Sorry guys.


00:25:28.798 --> 00:25:31.631
Guys... ten minutes tops!


00:25:34.137 --> 00:25:35.365
Moshi moshi, Arjun-san.


00:25:35.906 --> 00:25:37.703
Moshi moshi, Yamamoto-san.


00:25:39.809 --> 00:25:41.678
How are you?


00:25:41.678 --> 00:25:43.373
l'm fine, thank you.


00:25:44.514 --> 00:25:45.845
Moshi, moshi?.


00:25:46.983 --> 00:25:48.382
lt's Japanese for hello.


00:25:48.652 --> 00:25:51.018
- l assure you,
l will always be here for you.


00:25:54.524 --> 00:25:55.889
Kabira...


00:25:55.959 --> 00:25:57.654
look at this amazing view.


00:25:58.562 --> 00:26:00.257
And, now look at our friend.


00:26:00.864 --> 00:26:02.866
My team is going to
put together all the information.


00:26:02.866 --> 00:26:04.424
And you will have
the docket with you in three days.


00:26:06.202 --> 00:26:07.191
What happened to him, dude?


00:26:09.205 --> 00:26:10.729
lf you ask me...


00:26:10.807 --> 00:26:12.638
he has become mantally sick.


00:26:13.543 --> 00:26:16.103
And he needs the psychaitrixt.


00:26:17.647 --> 00:26:18.841
lsn't this from school?


00:26:19.215 --> 00:26:20.443
Not school.


00:26:20.517 --> 00:26:23.008
- Eschool!
- Eschool.


00:26:23.286 --> 00:26:24.020
Eschoo!.


00:26:24.020 --> 00:26:27.421
Because only the Mr. the Dubey
can the talk like this.


00:26:27.857 --> 00:26:30.052
The Mr. the Dubey.


00:26:30.126 --> 00:26:34.426
Are you mantally challanged my buy?


00:26:35.865 --> 00:26:36.832
Not buy.


00:26:38.468 --> 00:26:39.302
bwoy.


00:26:39.302 --> 00:26:41.471
- bwoy.


00:26:41.471 --> 00:26:43.373
Mantally challangedmy bwoy...


00:26:43.373 --> 00:26:44.362
Mantal bwoy.


00:26:46.476 --> 00:26:47.374
Thank you, Mr. Yamamoto.


00:26:50.146 --> 00:26:51.875
Let's go. l'm done.


00:26:52.148 --> 00:26:53.206
Arjun, my bwoy...


00:26:53.717 --> 00:26:56.550
you look the mantalin this the uniform!


00:26:58.455 --> 00:26:59.319
Let's go.


00:27:00.490 --> 00:27:02.617
Okay, the very the well the saids.


00:27:27.117 --> 00:27:28.685
Guys...


00:27:28.685 --> 00:27:30.516
just do as l say.


00:27:31.521 --> 00:27:34.357
lt's been ten years since college.
Please grow up.


00:27:34.357 --> 00:27:36.917
- Don't do this, please.
- Trust me.


00:27:36.993 --> 00:27:38.893
You'll kiss me later.


00:27:39.629 --> 00:27:41.197
When l shout...


00:27:41.197 --> 00:27:44.394
point to the urinal and
scream loudly.


00:28:03.319 --> 00:28:04.547
Bye!


00:28:11.294 --> 00:28:13.353
Dude, you're the mantallythe sick!


00:28:14.731 --> 00:28:17.291
People are the same everywhere.


00:28:17.367 --> 00:28:18.857
lt's just human nature.


00:28:24.741 --> 00:28:25.435
What are you doing?


00:28:27.877 --> 00:28:29.538
Poor thing's feeling hot.


00:28:31.147 --> 00:28:31.943
Poor thing?


00:28:32.215 --> 00:28:33.443
Kabira...


00:28:34.484 --> 00:28:36.782
meet Bagwati.


00:28:39.155 --> 00:28:41.646
What's happened to your jokes?


00:28:41.858 --> 00:28:43.155
Are they sick?


00:28:43.993 --> 00:28:46.791
Well, they've taken after you.


00:28:47.063 --> 00:28:49.554
Hey Joe, yes l spoke to
Mr. Yamamoto and...


00:28:50.333 --> 00:28:52.358
Somebody please
throw his phone out.


00:28:55.038 --> 00:28:56.062
What the...


00:28:58.241 --> 00:28:59.208
-Are you mad?


00:29:01.377 --> 00:29:02.366
Did you just...


00:29:14.190 --> 00:29:14.918
You think we'll get it?


00:29:19.162 --> 00:29:21.865
Sorry, l didn't think he would do it.


00:29:21.865 --> 00:29:23.560
Of course you didn't know, Kabir.


00:29:24.701 --> 00:29:25.827
Now go find my phone.


00:29:26.236 --> 00:29:27.260
- Where?
- l don't know.


00:29:27.337 --> 00:29:28.634
l want my phone, that's all.


00:29:28.905 --> 00:29:29.739
lt could've broken.


00:29:29.739 --> 00:29:31.934
Arjun, don't be silly...
we won't find it.


00:29:32.008 --> 00:29:32.838
Silly?


00:29:33.409 --> 00:29:35.639
You threw my phone out
of a moving car, you moron!


00:29:36.412 --> 00:29:38.607
He said it, l threw it.


00:29:38.681 --> 00:29:39.170
Didn't you?


00:29:39.382 --> 00:29:40.747
Kabir...


00:29:40.817 --> 00:29:42.375
please tell me to slap him.


00:29:42.452 --> 00:29:43.353
Don't be silly.


00:29:43.353 --> 00:29:44.251
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:44.654 --> 00:29:46.019
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:46.656 --> 00:29:47.452
Slap him.


00:29:50.493 --> 00:29:51.289
- What's wrong with you?
- Guys!


00:29:52.228 --> 00:29:54.093
l'll get you a new phone.
l was just joking.


00:29:54.230 --> 00:29:55.899
Well, it's not funny.


00:29:55.899 --> 00:29:57.526
That call was important.


00:29:58.301 --> 00:30:01.532
You think being 'cool and funny'
gives you the license to do anything?


00:30:01.971 --> 00:30:04.140
lt's always like,
'lmran said this. He's so funny.'


00:30:04.140 --> 00:30:05.909
lmran did that, he is so cool'.


00:30:05.909 --> 00:30:07.243
Grow up!


00:30:07.243 --> 00:30:09.234
Throwing my phone
out the window is not funny!


00:30:09.312 --> 00:30:12.611
Hooking up with my girlfriend
was not funny!


00:30:18.488 --> 00:30:19.455
Listen...


00:30:19.989 --> 00:30:21.547
it's been four years.


00:30:21.624 --> 00:30:23.193
And l've apologised for it.


00:30:23.193 --> 00:30:24.751
Now let it go.


00:30:25.395 --> 00:30:26.794
Or what? Huh, what?


00:30:27.463 --> 00:30:29.294
Stop it. Stop it, you two.


00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:32.194
You're behaving like kids.


00:30:34.537 --> 00:30:36.095
lf there's a problem,
deal with it.


00:30:36.172 --> 00:30:36.797
Like adults.


00:30:37.173 --> 00:30:38.333
Who made you the judge?


00:30:38.675 --> 00:30:39.742
Do you see anyone else here?


00:30:39.742 --> 00:30:40.470
Listen.


00:30:40.810 --> 00:30:42.378
Let's get this straight.


00:30:42.378 --> 00:30:43.538
l don't have any problem with him.


00:30:45.315 --> 00:30:47.350
Why would you have a problem?


00:30:47.350 --> 00:30:48.749
Sonali was my girlfriend.


00:30:49.052 --> 00:30:50.610
Come on, Sonali and me
fell in love.


00:30:51.988 --> 00:30:53.387
lt happens. Shit happens.


00:30:54.324 --> 00:30:54.722
Yeah.


00:30:55.959 --> 00:30:56.755
lt was shit.


00:30:57.827 --> 00:30:58.623
For me.


00:30:59.729 --> 00:31:02.095
And l'm sure you didn't
give it a second thought.


00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:05.460
lmran man...


00:31:06.569 --> 00:31:08.628
l would never do that to you.


00:31:08.972 --> 00:31:09.768
Arjun...


00:31:10.340 --> 00:31:12.535
l screwed up.
Now what do you want me to do?


00:31:13.142 --> 00:31:13.801
What do l do?


00:31:14.010 --> 00:31:15.341
Should l wear a 'Sorry, Arjun' t-shirt
and walk around?


00:31:15.712 --> 00:31:16.337
What should l do?


00:31:17.914 --> 00:31:18.573
Just look at him.


00:31:19.983 --> 00:31:21.348
Listen to me, okay.
You two, please!


00:31:22.018 --> 00:31:23.007
Sonali was a bitch.


00:31:23.987 --> 00:31:24.510
Understand?


00:31:24.687 --> 00:31:26.018
l'm sorry, really.


00:31:26.222 --> 00:31:27.780
She used you.


00:31:27.857 --> 00:31:29.256
Then gave you a BPL
and used him.


00:31:29.692 --> 00:31:31.023
And she dumped you as well.


00:31:31.628 --> 00:31:34.096
She was a waste of time then
and she is a waste of time now.


00:31:34.898 --> 00:31:38.231
Four years ago we cancelled
this trip because of her.


00:31:38.301 --> 00:31:41.293
Today we're here for me.
Don't let her ruin this.


00:31:41.537 --> 00:31:42.401
Please!


00:31:44.207 --> 00:31:45.697
How many times
do l have to apologise?


00:31:47.310 --> 00:31:49.175
How many times?
Let's just make it clear.


00:31:50.880 --> 00:31:53.348
Till it doesn't come from here.


00:32:00.323 --> 00:32:01.347
What's BPL?


00:32:02.292 --> 00:32:03.156
Bum Pe Laat.
[Kick in the arse.]


00:32:10.466 --> 00:32:11.501
You're crazy.


00:32:11.501 --> 00:32:14.026
Speak with him.
He slapped me.


00:32:16.339 --> 00:32:17.397
l can't believe this.


00:32:31.054 --> 00:32:32.419
Hi baby...


00:32:33.523 --> 00:32:34.251
Good.


00:32:35.358 --> 00:32:36.916
We've left Barcelona.


00:32:38.194 --> 00:32:39.491
On the road.


00:32:40.396 --> 00:32:41.920
Yes, it's beautiful.


00:32:43.232 --> 00:32:46.201
Of course, they're with me.
Where will they go?


00:32:48.371 --> 00:32:49.736
Everything is cool.


00:32:51.908 --> 00:32:52.875
Yeah.


00:33:09.959 --> 00:33:11.861
All ready.


00:33:11.861 --> 00:33:13.158
Come on.


00:33:15.565 --> 00:33:16.623
Yes!


00:33:16.699 --> 00:33:18.234
Now this is a house.


00:33:18.234 --> 00:33:19.929
- l like.
- Cool.


00:33:20.003 --> 00:33:21.204
lt's lovely.


00:33:21.204 --> 00:33:23.104
You haven't seen the half of it yet.


00:33:24.741 --> 00:33:25.765
Can we slide?


00:33:26.242 --> 00:33:27.140
No, you can't.


00:33:27.744 --> 00:33:28.911
- Captain.
-Amazing.


00:33:28.911 --> 00:33:30.242
Wow, man!


00:33:30.913 --> 00:33:32.574
This is nicer than the pictures.


00:33:38.187 --> 00:33:39.055
Amazing.


00:33:39.055 --> 00:33:40.044
What a view!


00:33:44.193 --> 00:33:45.353
Someday.


00:34:30.807 --> 00:34:31.974
How was it?


00:34:31.974 --> 00:34:32.998
Refreshing.


00:34:35.411 --> 00:34:37.140
Who is she?


00:34:37.213 --> 00:34:38.339
How should l know, dude?


00:34:40.716 --> 00:34:41.774
She's nice.


00:34:43.286 --> 00:34:44.617
Really nice.


00:34:47.490 --> 00:34:48.650
What's happening?


00:34:49.559 --> 00:34:51.220
She's got me.
She's pulling me towards her.


00:34:52.728 --> 00:34:53.626
She's pulling me.


00:34:53.696 --> 00:34:55.027
l saw her first.


00:34:56.532 --> 00:34:57.590
So true.


00:34:58.835 --> 00:35:01.497
But has she seen you?


00:35:04.407 --> 00:35:05.101
What?


00:35:06.843 --> 00:35:09.368
- Hola.
- Hola.


00:35:10.746 --> 00:35:11.405
Can l try that?


00:35:13.282 --> 00:35:13.680
Yeah.


00:35:14.383 --> 00:35:15.077
Thanks.


00:35:19.822 --> 00:35:21.324
Where are you from?


00:35:21.324 --> 00:35:22.052
Brazil?


00:35:23.292 --> 00:35:24.520
Half US, half lndia.


00:35:25.228 --> 00:35:25.922
lndia?


00:35:27.363 --> 00:35:28.830
What a coincidence!
Which part?


00:35:29.565 --> 00:35:31.795
My dad's from Delhi but
l live in London.


00:35:32.969 --> 00:35:34.527
Hindi? Not bad!


00:35:34.971 --> 00:35:36.962
You too... wow!


00:35:40.209 --> 00:35:43.178
lf you're free,
want to join me for a drink?


00:35:48.518 --> 00:35:49.507
l have an early morning.


00:35:50.686 --> 00:35:51.550
Sorry.


00:35:57.460 --> 00:35:58.427
Thanks.


00:36:08.037 --> 00:36:08.560
Bye.


00:36:13.075 --> 00:36:14.599
What's your name?


00:36:14.677 --> 00:36:15.473
Laila.


00:36:15.978 --> 00:36:16.672
lmran.


00:36:17.413 --> 00:36:20.109
But my friends call me 'Romeo'.


00:36:32.228 --> 00:36:33.396
Romeo?


00:36:33.396 --> 00:36:35.694
Seriously man... Romeo?


00:36:36.999 --> 00:36:38.398
l mean, chee!


00:36:38.901 --> 00:36:39.595
Arjun...


00:36:40.736 --> 00:36:42.704
lt's a man's duty to try.


00:36:43.539 --> 00:36:46.235
Success and failure are in His hands.


00:36:46.576 --> 00:36:48.237
Great, professor.


00:36:50.046 --> 00:36:51.206
Seriously?


00:36:51.514 --> 00:36:53.311
You got me this time!


00:37:04.293 --> 00:37:05.021
What the hell is this?


00:37:06.128 --> 00:37:06.924
What?


00:37:10.566 --> 00:37:11.897
This! What the hell is this?


00:37:12.301 --> 00:37:14.503
You said l had to
get you a new phone.


00:37:14.503 --> 00:37:15.697
You didn't specify which one.


00:37:16.305 --> 00:37:17.673
l'm a trader.


00:37:17.673 --> 00:37:18.867
Not a Japanese school girl.


00:37:19.809 --> 00:37:20.639
Moshi moshi.


00:37:21.978 --> 00:37:23.809
Shut up, just shut up!


00:37:24.213 --> 00:37:26.681
- Just don't talk to me.
- Guys that's enough!


00:37:27.617 --> 00:37:29.642
Look at this.
What's wrong with him?


00:37:30.720 --> 00:37:31.618
What's wrong with you?


00:37:31.988 --> 00:37:33.353
lt's funny.


00:37:34.457 --> 00:37:35.625
Anyway, now listen.


00:37:35.625 --> 00:37:37.252
Why we are here in Costa Brava.


00:37:38.561 --> 00:37:39.391
Ready for this?


00:37:40.329 --> 00:37:40.727
Yeah.


00:37:43.499 --> 00:37:44.693
Deep... sea...


00:37:45.368 --> 00:37:45.925
diving.


00:37:48.004 --> 00:37:48.663
What?


00:37:49.505 --> 00:37:51.666
Yes, our training begins
first thing tomorrow.


00:37:52.341 --> 00:37:54.010
l'm sorry but...


00:37:54.010 --> 00:37:56.178
why is this turning into a
let's torture Arjun holiday?


00:37:56.178 --> 00:37:57.546
l just don't understand.


00:37:57.546 --> 00:37:59.215
Relax, l know.


00:37:59.215 --> 00:38:01.115
l spoke with the people
at the diving school.


00:38:01.183 --> 00:38:03.185
You don't need to know how to swim.


00:38:03.185 --> 00:38:05.050
At least you know how to drown.


00:38:05.121 --> 00:38:07.523
Listen, just keep quiet. Just...


00:38:07.523 --> 00:38:08.683
keep quiet.


00:38:09.692 --> 00:38:10.420
Kabir...


00:38:10.660 --> 00:38:12.855
l don't understand how you thought
l'll do this.


00:38:13.162 --> 00:38:14.288
What's wrong with you?


00:38:21.637 --> 00:38:22.831
Bathroom... to the left.


00:38:31.080 --> 00:38:31.876
Okay, listen.


00:38:32.381 --> 00:38:34.941
l know you're scared of water.


00:38:35.151 --> 00:38:35.480
Okay.


00:38:35.818 --> 00:38:38.844
But then that's the challenge.
And it's completely safe.


00:38:39.288 --> 00:38:40.656
Think about it.


00:38:40.656 --> 00:38:42.214
Blue waters... okay?


00:38:42.291 --> 00:38:43.918
Fish swimming close to you.


00:38:44.627 --> 00:38:45.787
Corals...


00:38:47.463 --> 00:38:48.487
lt'll be amazing.


00:38:52.868 --> 00:38:55.860
Look, if you're not comfortable,
no one's going to force you.


00:38:57.073 --> 00:38:59.064
No, l'm serious, it's okay.


00:38:59.508 --> 00:39:00.839
Okay. Fine.


00:39:13.956 --> 00:39:14.513
Kabir Dewan?


00:39:16.492 --> 00:39:17.560
Laila?


00:39:17.560 --> 00:39:18.049
Hey.


00:39:18.127 --> 00:39:19.526
Hi, what are you doing here?


00:39:20.162 --> 00:39:21.686
Following you, l guess.


00:39:22.531 --> 00:39:23.361
Really?


00:39:24.066 --> 00:39:25.090
No.


00:39:25.534 --> 00:39:27.434
l'm here to train you.


00:39:27.670 --> 00:39:28.534
l'm an instructor here.


00:39:29.071 --> 00:39:29.765
Wow!


00:39:30.673 --> 00:39:32.875
- Hi, l'm Kabir.
- Laila.


00:39:32.875 --> 00:39:34.274
- This is Arjun.
- Hi.


00:39:34.343 --> 00:39:34.809
Laila.


00:39:37.179 --> 00:39:37.702
Romeo?


00:39:38.714 --> 00:39:39.442
You remember?


00:39:41.517 --> 00:39:42.885
Arjun...


00:39:42.885 --> 00:39:46.343
lf you don't want to dive,
it's totally fine.


00:39:47.823 --> 00:39:48.881
He can't swim.


00:39:51.494 --> 00:39:52.825
lt's okay, doesn't matter.


00:39:53.462 --> 00:39:54.429
You'll be fine.


00:39:56.365 --> 00:39:56.990
Thank you.


00:39:58.367 --> 00:39:59.425
Shall we start?


00:40:00.136 --> 00:40:01.000
Let's go.


00:40:01.570 --> 00:40:03.595
lt's a little difficult to
talk under water.


00:40:03.672 --> 00:40:05.139
For obvious reasons.


00:40:05.341 --> 00:40:06.899
So these signs are very important.


00:40:08.377 --> 00:40:09.241
Up.


00:40:10.679 --> 00:40:11.941
Down.


00:40:12.715 --> 00:40:14.046
Okay.


00:40:14.850 --> 00:40:16.010
Not okay.


00:40:17.353 --> 00:40:18.513
Air guage.


00:40:20.322 --> 00:40:20.879
Okay?


00:40:22.992 --> 00:40:23.651
Okay?


00:40:26.061 --> 00:40:26.686
Alright!


00:40:29.298 --> 00:40:30.993
You have to wear a wet suit.


00:40:31.634 --> 00:40:32.658
The water is pretty cold.


00:40:33.903 --> 00:40:36.804
Next is the BCD.
Your buoyancy control device.


00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:39.264
All okay?


00:40:40.509 --> 00:40:43.137
These weights will help you
remain underwater.


00:40:50.019 --> 00:40:51.748
Finally, your fins.


00:42:22.144 --> 00:42:23.412
Cheers. Salut.


00:42:23.412 --> 00:42:24.310
Good job, boys.


00:42:30.219 --> 00:42:31.550
So, when is the wedding?


00:42:33.355 --> 00:42:34.390
ln two months.


00:42:34.390 --> 00:42:37.052
- That's like now, man.
- Yeah, l know.


00:42:37.126 --> 00:42:39.617
We only started dating
about six months ago.


00:42:40.062 --> 00:42:41.222
Well, you know what they say...


00:42:41.297 --> 00:42:42.321
when it's right, it's right.


00:42:42.698 --> 00:42:43.687
That's what l said.


00:42:44.300 --> 00:42:45.130
Actually, she said it.


00:42:48.337 --> 00:42:49.133
What does she do?


00:42:49.572 --> 00:42:51.403
lnterior design.
And she's bloody good.


00:42:52.074 --> 00:42:52.802
Okay.


00:42:52.875 --> 00:42:54.604
And of course,
her father has a hotel business...


00:42:54.677 --> 00:42:55.871
that's evaluated at...


00:42:56.645 --> 00:42:57.771
Ten billion?


00:42:58.247 --> 00:42:59.077
Ten billion.


00:43:00.349 --> 00:43:03.079
l'm not marrying her for her money.


00:43:03.152 --> 00:43:05.054
Kabir, of course not.


00:43:05.054 --> 00:43:07.113
But you've got to admit,
it's a plus point.


00:43:07.690 --> 00:43:10.181
Plus point?
Are you serious?


00:43:10.659 --> 00:43:13.219
Would you marry for money?


00:43:14.029 --> 00:43:14.893
Depends.


00:43:15.364 --> 00:43:16.262
How much?


00:43:18.300 --> 00:43:19.358
Ten billion!


00:43:20.336 --> 00:43:21.234
Definitely.


00:43:22.071 --> 00:43:23.936
And what if she's a bore?


00:43:25.474 --> 00:43:29.808
When you have ten billion in your bank
who needs the wife for entertainment?


00:43:29.979 --> 00:43:32.277
- Romantic.
- l agree, it's true.


00:43:32.648 --> 00:43:34.138
- Cheers!


00:43:36.952 --> 00:43:37.976
Are you seeing someone?


00:43:39.622 --> 00:43:40.748
Do you have a girlfriend?


00:43:41.390 --> 00:43:42.379
No.


00:43:43.959 --> 00:43:46.328
Hey... what about Rohini?
What happened there?


00:43:46.328 --> 00:43:48.397
- She was nice.
- Well...


00:43:48.397 --> 00:43:50.592
l guess she wanted
different things out of life.


00:43:51.333 --> 00:43:52.300
Laila...


00:43:53.068 --> 00:43:56.094
apart from my body
what else do you want out of life?


00:44:01.677 --> 00:44:04.976
l don't know.
l haven't really made a list.


00:44:05.314 --> 00:44:06.281
Still...


00:44:07.282 --> 00:44:08.772
there must be something.


00:44:11.720 --> 00:44:14.848
l guess, l want that...


00:44:15.224 --> 00:44:17.556
life should continue to surprise me.


00:44:18.160 --> 00:44:19.320
lnspire me.


00:44:21.463 --> 00:44:22.862
Make me meet new people.


00:44:23.032 --> 00:44:23.726
Hola.


00:44:25.167 --> 00:44:25.997
Hola.


00:44:26.969 --> 00:44:27.799
Hola?


00:44:28.537 --> 00:44:29.526
Sorry.


00:44:30.305 --> 00:44:31.602
Give me new experiences.


00:44:32.241 --> 00:44:33.265
And...


00:44:34.376 --> 00:44:35.502
l want...


00:44:36.879 --> 00:44:38.107
you to get me a drink.


00:44:40.616 --> 00:44:41.605
Your wish is my command.


00:44:41.784 --> 00:44:43.251
- One for me, please.
- Arjun?


00:44:44.019 --> 00:44:45.077
l'm okay.


00:44:52.194 --> 00:44:55.254
- Keep it down.
- Guys we're gonna get arrested.


00:44:59.535 --> 00:45:01.264
He's here. Quiet.


00:45:04.373 --> 00:45:05.863
l was just telling...


00:45:06.709 --> 00:45:09.371
that's the problem you see.


00:45:23.225 --> 00:45:24.249
Sorry.


00:45:48.383 --> 00:45:50.214
Your life is about to change.


00:45:52.721 --> 00:45:53.847
That's if l survive!


00:45:56.992 --> 00:45:57.981
We'll see.


00:46:01.563 --> 00:46:03.121
Yup, we'll see.


00:49:51.626 --> 00:49:54.151
The moment flows by like molten sapphire


00:49:56.498 --> 00:49:58.693
Deep blue silences


00:50:00.569 --> 00:50:03.470
No earth below, no sky above


00:50:05.807 --> 00:50:08.833
The rustling branches and leaves


00:50:10.979 --> 00:50:13.345
Are saying only you are here


00:50:15.784 --> 00:50:16.808
Only me


00:50:18.120 --> 00:50:20.111
My breath and my heartbeat


00:50:22.524 --> 00:50:25.357
Such depth, such solitude


00:50:27.029 --> 00:50:28.553
And me


00:50:28.964 --> 00:50:29.828
Only me


00:50:31.533 --> 00:50:33.865
I now believe I exist


00:50:46.848 --> 00:50:50.147
Baby, it was amazing.
You should definitely do it.


00:50:50.519 --> 00:50:52.180
l have no interest.


00:50:52.687 --> 00:50:53.555
Hey!


00:50:53.555 --> 00:50:54.214
Hey...


00:50:54.289 --> 00:50:56.757
Sorry. Can l use your loo?
lmran is taking a shower.


00:50:57.059 --> 00:50:57.684
Sure.


00:50:58.460 --> 00:50:59.324
Who is that?


00:50:59.728 --> 00:51:01.093
Wait. First say hi to Natasha.


00:51:02.497 --> 00:51:03.464
Okay.


00:51:04.399 --> 00:51:06.230
Hey... l'm Laila.


00:51:07.903 --> 00:51:08.597
Hi.


00:51:08.904 --> 00:51:11.236
Kabir has told me a lot about you.


00:51:11.306 --> 00:51:12.671
Congratulations in advance.


00:51:13.208 --> 00:51:14.106
Thanks.


00:51:14.509 --> 00:51:16.500
Well, it's really nice to meet you.


00:51:17.245 --> 00:51:19.270
- Bye.
- Bye.


00:51:21.149 --> 00:51:22.138
Who is that?


00:51:22.784 --> 00:51:24.152
That's Laila, our instructor.


00:51:24.152 --> 00:51:25.654
She's studying fashion in London but...


00:51:25.654 --> 00:51:28.557
three months a year she works
at dive sites around the world.


00:51:28.557 --> 00:51:29.724
lsn't that cool?


00:51:29.724 --> 00:51:30.559
Very cool.


00:51:30.559 --> 00:51:32.356
What is she doing in your room?


00:51:32.727 --> 00:51:34.092
She's using the bathroom.


00:51:37.699 --> 00:51:40.235
lmran invited her over for dinner.


00:51:40.235 --> 00:51:42.396
To celebrate our first dive.


00:51:42.838 --> 00:51:43.896
D'you think l'm stupid?


00:51:44.239 --> 00:51:46.139
What? lt's the truth.


00:51:46.208 --> 00:51:47.232
Arjun is cooking.


00:51:47.476 --> 00:51:49.637
Yeah, you must be very busy.
l'll speak to you later.


00:51:50.312 --> 00:51:51.870
Natasha, why are you getting upset?


00:51:52.180 --> 00:51:54.375
l'm not upset.
l've a flight to catch.


00:51:55.150 --> 00:51:56.481
You're being really silly.


00:51:56.618 --> 00:51:57.642
Yeah, l know. Bye.


00:52:00.055 --> 00:52:00.919
Bye.


00:52:04.292 --> 00:52:07.193
- All okay?
- Yeah, fine.


00:52:07.729 --> 00:52:09.594
- See you downstairs.
- See you.


00:52:20.642 --> 00:52:23.011
Need some help?


00:52:23.011 --> 00:52:24.706
Nope. Almost done.


00:52:28.450 --> 00:52:29.784
Paella.


00:52:29.784 --> 00:52:30.751
- Yup.
- Very nice.


00:52:31.453 --> 00:52:32.317
Thanks.


00:52:37.559 --> 00:52:38.526
So...


00:52:39.294 --> 00:52:40.852
you didn't tell me how it was.


00:52:44.065 --> 00:52:45.032
Thank you.


00:52:45.534 --> 00:52:48.367
Don't thank me.
You did it.


00:52:50.038 --> 00:52:53.007
So, how was it?


00:52:56.211 --> 00:52:57.542
lt was magical.


00:52:59.781 --> 00:53:02.306
lt felt like the
most peaceful place on earth.


00:53:04.819 --> 00:53:05.979
lt was beautiful.


00:53:07.656 --> 00:53:10.147
l was 16 when l did my first dive.


00:53:10.625 --> 00:53:13.526
And then stopping myself
was impossible.


00:53:14.396 --> 00:53:16.227
Yeah, it could be addictive.


00:53:16.698 --> 00:53:17.494
Addictive?


00:53:18.233 --> 00:53:19.222
No.


00:53:19.634 --> 00:53:21.192
Addiction is such a negative word.


00:53:21.870 --> 00:53:23.030
Diving is...


00:53:23.705 --> 00:53:25.002
something else for me.


00:53:25.507 --> 00:53:27.236
lt's like meditation.


00:53:28.476 --> 00:53:32.503
You're conscious of
every breath, every moment.


00:53:33.215 --> 00:53:34.614
Just imagine...


00:53:34.683 --> 00:53:37.015
living your whole life like that.


00:53:37.686 --> 00:53:40.086
Be fully alive to each and every moment.


00:53:44.226 --> 00:53:45.124
Delicious.


00:53:45.193 --> 00:53:46.057
- Seriously.
- Thank you.


00:53:46.127 --> 00:53:47.185
You should cook more often.


00:53:47.562 --> 00:53:48.586
l know man but...


00:53:48.964 --> 00:53:50.022
where's the time!


00:53:54.002 --> 00:53:56.129
So, the fear of water still there?


00:53:57.172 --> 00:53:58.139
Now there's no fear.


00:53:59.207 --> 00:54:00.231
Not even of life.


00:54:02.410 --> 00:54:05.038
Wow! ln one dunk
you've unravelled the mystery of life!


00:54:05.513 --> 00:54:06.241
Well done, my lad.


00:54:08.283 --> 00:54:09.773
Actually, it's quite simple.


00:54:11.019 --> 00:54:11.986
What is it?


00:54:14.522 --> 00:54:15.489
Just...


00:54:16.725 --> 00:54:17.692
keep breathing.


00:54:24.199 --> 00:54:25.393
Laila!


00:54:26.201 --> 00:54:28.601
Finally, our old friend has surfaced.


00:54:29.571 --> 00:54:31.596
And to avoid a relapse...


00:54:32.040 --> 00:54:34.099
why don't you join us on the trip?


00:54:34.743 --> 00:54:35.903
l'd love to.


00:54:35.977 --> 00:54:37.501
But l'm off to Bunol tomorrow.


00:54:37.912 --> 00:54:39.345
lt's the Tomatina festival.


00:54:39.514 --> 00:54:40.412
- Too bad!
- ls it?


00:54:40.482 --> 00:54:42.384
Toma-tina, what's that?


00:54:42.384 --> 00:54:43.715
Arjun!


00:54:44.185 --> 00:54:45.887
How can you not know that...


00:54:45.887 --> 00:54:49.448
it is world s largest tomato fight?!


00:54:51.626 --> 00:54:54.362
lt's like our festival of colours.
But played with tomatoes instead.


00:54:54.362 --> 00:54:55.363
Really?


00:54:55.363 --> 00:54:57.899
Actually, you guys should come.


00:54:57.899 --> 00:54:59.093
lt'll be a blast.


00:55:00.568 --> 00:55:01.091
l'm in.


00:55:01.503 --> 00:55:02.570
-Are you serious?
- Yeah, l'm in.


00:55:02.570 --> 00:55:04.299
What? No!


00:55:04.372 --> 00:55:05.573
We're leaving for Seville tomorrow.


00:55:05.573 --> 00:55:07.302
That's perfect.
Bunol is en-route.


00:55:07.809 --> 00:55:09.003
- Come on.


00:55:10.078 --> 00:55:12.444
Look, Seville is Arjun's choice.


00:55:13.214 --> 00:55:14.340
He made the reservations.


00:55:15.884 --> 00:55:18.876
To mess with Arjun's reservations is...


00:55:18.953 --> 00:55:20.420
like inviting Death!


00:55:26.628 --> 00:55:27.526
Come on.


00:55:31.700 --> 00:55:34.225
Alright, let me see what l can do.


00:55:38.073 --> 00:55:39.267
ls that your phone?


00:55:45.480 --> 00:55:46.469
lt's a long story.


00:55:47.382 --> 00:55:48.371
Let's not go there.


00:55:48.450 --> 00:55:49.747
No, it's nice.


00:55:50.719 --> 00:55:52.220
He's very much in touch
with his feminine side.


00:55:52.220 --> 00:55:53.278
Eat your food.


00:55:53.355 --> 00:55:55.857
Don't worry, even l like pink.


00:55:55.857 --> 00:55:57.256
Great, l feel much better.
Thank you.


00:56:05.367 --> 00:56:06.527
How could you do this?


00:56:07.035 --> 00:56:08.903
Rohini, l'm really sorry but...


00:56:08.903 --> 00:56:10.598
can't you see that
this deal could help me.


00:56:10.672 --> 00:56:12.401
Can't you see that maybe l don't care!


00:56:12.540 --> 00:56:13.742
You don't care.


00:56:13.742 --> 00:56:15.972
- You don't care about my life?
- Stop it, Arjun.


00:56:16.044 --> 00:56:18.444
Don't confuse your work with your life.


00:56:18.680 --> 00:56:21.706
Your work isn't your life.
lt's just a part of it.


00:56:22.050 --> 00:56:25.053
Just like this relationship
is a part of your life.


00:56:25.053 --> 00:56:26.953
- What about this?
- What about this?


00:56:27.489 --> 00:56:29.889
l bought this apartment so that
we could live together.


00:56:29.958 --> 00:56:31.860
What? Please!


00:56:31.860 --> 00:56:36.364
You bought this apartment to impress people
with your up market address.


00:56:36.364 --> 00:56:38.032
l can't believe you just said that.


00:56:38.032 --> 00:56:41.229
- l'm planning a future with you.
- Our future will come tomorrow, Arjun.


00:56:41.302 --> 00:56:43.338
- Don't scream!
- Where is our today?


00:56:43.338 --> 00:56:44.506
Don't scream.


00:56:44.506 --> 00:56:45.632
Then listen to me.


00:56:48.009 --> 00:56:49.067
What do you want?


00:56:49.544 --> 00:56:51.102
l want to spend time with you.


00:56:51.179 --> 00:56:54.716
l want a relationship.
Not a retirement plan.


00:56:54.716 --> 00:56:56.206
Please, Rohini.


00:56:56.885 --> 00:56:59.387
The chairman of Nakatomi Corporation
wants a meeting with me.


00:56:59.387 --> 00:57:01.116
What do l do?
l have to go.


00:57:02.690 --> 00:57:06.387
lf the presentation does it,
he'll give us the entire account.


00:57:06.461 --> 00:57:08.830
That will boost my career.


00:57:08.830 --> 00:57:10.388
Can't you see that?


00:57:10.465 --> 00:57:11.625
What about our deal?


00:57:12.734 --> 00:57:15.362
We can go next month.


00:57:16.337 --> 00:57:18.066
lt's my birthday, Arjun.


00:57:19.073 --> 00:57:22.042
- l know.
- lt won't come next month.


00:57:22.911 --> 00:57:27.177
You had promised that we would
go to ltaly no matter what.


00:57:27.882 --> 00:57:30.350
And you cancelled the tickets
without even talking to me.


00:57:32.954 --> 00:57:35.081
Rohini, l really am sorry.


00:57:36.057 --> 00:57:38.184
Please understand. Just a second.


00:57:39.461 --> 00:57:42.487
lt's an important call.
Just one second.


00:57:42.730 --> 00:57:44.197
Rohini, one second.
Hello...


00:57:46.668 --> 00:57:47.692
Yes, Alex...


00:57:48.803 --> 00:57:50.998
l'll be there in ten minutes.


00:58:14.829 --> 00:58:17.999
Hey babe, l guess you're on the plane.


00:58:17.999 --> 00:58:22.871
l called to say that we're going to
Bunol tomorrow, for the Tomatina festiva


00:58:22.871 --> 00:58:24.862
Laila is taking us.


00:58:25.573 --> 00:58:27.063
Please don't be upset.


00:58:28.910 --> 00:58:32.505
Please call when you get this message.
l love you.


00:58:38.119 --> 00:58:39.313
Where the hell is he?


00:58:47.395 --> 00:58:49.727
Oh - my - God!


00:58:56.204 --> 00:58:59.901
- l love it.
- Unbelievable!


00:58:59.974 --> 00:59:01.999
- Okay.
- Yes?


00:59:02.810 --> 00:59:04.038
- Can l drive?
- No.


00:59:05.046 --> 00:59:05.978
Kabira...


00:59:06.614 --> 00:59:09.851
if four days of diving
can do this to you.


00:59:09.851 --> 00:59:12.547
Trust me, you should stay under water.


00:59:12.820 --> 00:59:15.690
Who knows if l'll be with you guys again...


00:59:15.690 --> 00:59:17.892
l decided, it's all or bust!


00:59:17.892 --> 00:59:19.553
- Right?
- Correct.


00:59:19.627 --> 00:59:21.729
Dude, you're getting married.


00:59:21.729 --> 00:59:23.924
You're not going to prison.


00:59:23.998 --> 00:59:25.056
Thanks.


00:59:26.000 --> 00:59:27.024
All set?


00:59:27.302 --> 00:59:28.326
- Arjun...


00:59:28.703 --> 00:59:29.761
can you help me?


00:59:30.171 --> 00:59:32.574
- lt's to the right.
- lt's jammed, what did you do?


00:59:32.574 --> 00:59:33.302
Dude!


00:59:35.176 --> 00:59:36.700
You have to apply some force.


00:59:46.988 --> 00:59:47.955
- Hi.
- Hello.


00:59:49.958 --> 00:59:50.925
Child!


00:59:51.659 --> 00:59:52.827
Relax in the front seat.


00:59:52.827 --> 00:59:54.385
Driver... Bunol.


00:59:55.129 --> 00:59:58.030
So Lailaji, hale and hearty
both packed in the bag?


01:00:04.639 --> 01:00:05.606
No, thanks.


01:00:21.055 --> 01:00:22.613
What are you doing?


01:00:23.224 --> 01:00:26.625
Laila, meet Bagwati.


01:00:29.864 --> 01:00:31.354
Hi Bagwati.


01:00:34.636 --> 01:00:36.536
Bagwatithinks you are very beautiful.


01:00:37.305 --> 01:00:38.636
Thank you, Bagwati.


01:00:42.343 --> 01:00:43.833
The evening was hazy...


01:00:44.345 --> 01:00:46.506
The mood was sad...


