01:16:25.392 --> 01:16:27.060
He is a slave.


01:16:27.061 --> 01:16:30.731
And one who only thinks of his career,
isnt your type either.


01:16:30.731 --> 01:16:33.859
If he only thinks about his career,
then he is a bore.


01:16:34.969 --> 01:16:38.132
