01:20:10.050 --> 01:20:11.176
Wow man.


01:20:13.854 --> 01:20:15.378
I should learn from you.


01:20:18.859 --> 01:20:21.919
I feel like Ive spent my life in a box.


01:20:24.498 --> 01:20:25.965
