01:21:27.294 --> 01:21:29.785
And if you and Sameera
ever decide to go on a trip...


01:21:30.564 --> 01:21:31.758
why would I stop you?


01:21:31.965 --> 01:21:35.202
And if I told you
that weve met some guys...


01:21:35.202 --> 01:21:37.534
and made dinner plans
with them, then?


01:21:38.038 --> 01:21:38.902
Then what?


01:21:39.373 --> 01:21:40.203
Then what?


01:21:40.807 --> 01:21:42.743
I trust you.


01:21:42.743 --> 01:21:45.871
Of course Id want
you both to be safe...


01:21:46.546 --> 01:21:47.945
but besides that,
I wont suspect you.


01:21:48.015 --> 01:21:50.347
Im sorry, but its easier said than done.


01:21:52.519 --> 01:21:53.178
Babe...


01:21:55.022 --> 01:21:56.717
youre welcome to stay
if you want to.


01:21:56.790 --> 01:21:59.520
But if you don't,
III drive you to the airport tomorrow.


01:22:02.696 --> 01:22:03.594
Good night.


01:22:15.676 --> 01:22:17.837
- III miss you.
- Take care.


01:22:18.879 --> 01:22:20.779
Stay in touch. See at the wedding.


01:22:20.847 --> 01:22:22.405
- Imran, can you help me?
- Of course.


01:22:22.482 --> 01:22:23.684
For sure. Okay?


01:22:23.685 --> 01:22:25.385
- Email me.
- I will.


01:22:25.385 --> 01:22:26.215
Good luck.


01:22:29.356 --> 01:22:30.414
Hey...


01:22:35.562 --> 01:22:37.257
Yesterday was...


01:22:41.335 --> 01:22:42.825
I had the best time yesterday.


01:22:44.404 --> 01:22:45.530
Me too.


01:22:47.407 --> 01:22:49.242
And good luck...


01:22:49.242 --> 01:22:51.540
for your upcoming adventures.


01:22:53.647 --> 01:22:54.875
Thanks.


01:23:09.663 --> 01:23:10.630
III see you.


01:23:13.900 --> 01:23:14.559
Bye.


01:23:18.372 --> 01:23:19.339
Bye.


01:23:19.806 --> 01:23:20.670
Ciao.


01:23:44.698 --> 01:23:47.567
<i>A thought came alive, but away it hid.</i>


01:23:47.567 --> 01:23:50.297
<i>It stole a glance, from under the eyelids.</i>


01:23:50.370 --> 01:23:54.602
<i>Sometimes from you, sometimes from me</i>
it asked for words to set it free.


01:23:57.344 --> 01:24:00.714
<i>Words to wear, so from
the lips it can flee.</i>


01:24:00.714 --> 01:24:04.275
<i>A voice it can embrace and sway with glee.</i>


01:24:05.452 --> 01:24:09.286
<i>But this thought</i>
Is a feeling... just a feeling.


01:24:12.793 --> 01:24:15.091
<i>Like a fragrance floating in the breeze.</i>


01:24:15.796 --> 01:24:18.094
<i>A fragrance that is unspeaking.</i>


01:24:18.865 --> 01:24:21.535
<i>You live with it.</i>


01:24:21.535 --> 01:24:23.594
<i>I'm aware of it.</i>


01:24:24.237 --> 01:24:26.228
<i>Out in the open for the world to see.</i>


01:24:26.306 --> 01:24:28.536
<i>What is this unknown mystery?</i>


01:26:13.613 --> 01:26:14.602
Laila?


01:26:23.056 --> 01:26:24.353
Youll forgot something?


01:26:45.045 --> 01:26:46.774
I hate regrets.


01:26:49.449 --> 01:26:50.916
Then you shouldn't have any.


01:27:08.969 --> 01:27:09.958
Bye.


01:27:29.456 --> 01:27:33.693
<i>Flying away in the open sky...</i>


01:27:33.693 --> 01:27:37.993
<i>Are the birds of my dreams.</i>


01:27:40.734 --> 01:27:43.567
<i>Flying away...</i>


01:27:44.304 --> 01:27:49.003
<i>To the land of my heart</i>
are the birds of my dreams.


01:27:54.180 --> 01:27:59.550
<i>Don't know where they'll go next.</i>


01:28:02.622 --> 01:28:07.753
<i>Wings have taken flight and</i>
now says my sight you've finally awoken.


01:28:08.228 --> 01:28:13.427
<i>What was on your mind is left behind</i>
You've moved far ahead in time.


01:28:14.401 --> 01:28:19.395
<i>Life is floating on a breeze.</i>


01:28:20.073 --> 01:28:24.942
<i>Life is telling you and me.</i>


01:28:28.381 --> 01:28:32.750
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:10.390 --> 01:29:15.760
<i>A touch from someone</i>
and I've been wandering without a thought.


01:29:16.062 --> 01:29:22.235
<i>Somewhere new words were spoken</i>
and since then I've been lost.


01:29:22.235 --> 01:29:27.263
<i>Something made the heart melt.</i>


01:29:27.974 --> 01:29:32.775
<i>In a blink, I was someone else.</i>


01:29:36.182 --> 01:29:40.380
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:49.863 --> 01:29:58.271
<i>A light shone down</i> Now there's a
beauty being showered on the streets.


01:30:01.207 --> 01:30:09.740
<i>Happiness came down</i>
Now there's a zest being showered upon me.


01:30:11.117 --> 01:30:17.420
<i>Now I finally know who I was meant to be.</i>


01:30:20.860 --> 01:30:26.594
<i>Do you remember that moment yesterday</i>
The one with the magic force?


01:30:26.666 --> 01:30:32.730
<i>It transformed us into something new</i>
I wonder which moment it was?


01:30:32.806 --> 01:30:36.640
<i>The heart says just blindly go to.</i>


01:30:38.445 --> 01:30:43.178
<i>Any place that desire takes you.</i>


01:30:46.786 --> 01:30:52.782
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:31:23.990 --> 01:31:24.088
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:24.089 --> 01:31:25.825
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:25.826 --> 01:31:27.060
Meaning?


01:31:27.060 --> 01:31:29.221
