01:31:35.635 --> 01:31:38.238
then I want to redo the house.


01:31:38.238 --> 01:31:40.433
That will take about a year.


01:31:41.007 --> 01:31:43.576
And if youre going
to Singapore for your new project...


01:31:43.576 --> 01:31:45.407
