01:31:48.982 --> 01:31:51.314
that hotel is your dream project, Natasha.


01:31:51.651 --> 01:31:53.175
Dreams change baby.


01:31:54.120 --> 01:31:57.190
Then, I didn't know Id be getting married.


01:31:57.190 --> 01:31:58.157
Married?


01:31:59.392 --> 01:32:01.223
