01:32:05.698 --> 01:32:09.225
After the wedding, even you wouldnt
want to go on this kind of boys holiday.


01:32:21.481 --> 01:32:23.642
- When is her flight?
- At 6 p.m.


01:32:26.486 --> 01:32:28.852
Dont worry man, well make it.


01:32:30.023 --> 01:32:30.853
Yeah.


01:32:36.629 --> 01:32:37.755
Very funny!


01:32:40.900 --> 01:32:41.730
All okay, babe?


01:32:42.335 --> 01:32:43.063
Yeah.


01:32:43.836 --> 01:32:45.030
Can I drive?


01:32:48.041 --> 01:32:49.770
Can you drive?


01:32:57.450 --> 01:33:00.987
Babe, the speed limit is 120.
You can go faster.


01:33:00.987 --> 01:33:03.148
