01:33:14.033 --> 01:33:15.364
Dont talk to her.


01:33:20.540 --> 01:33:21.700
I love this song.


01:33:25.345 --> 01:33:28.872
Rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:31.951 --> 01:33:35.944
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:39.125 --> 01:33:43.152
Nothing rocks better than
a rock chick girl...


01:33:45.965 --> 01:33:50.265
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:54.407 --> 01:33:55.567
I had fun.


01:33:59.012 --> 01:33:59.876
Listen...


01:34:03.616 --> 01:34:04.640
