a personal problem, then who will?


01:34:44.457 --> 01:34:45.858
Forget it man!


01:34:45.858 --> 01:34:48.190
Theyll sort their problem
and well get screwed in the middle.


01:34:48.327 --> 01:34:49.191
<i>Chee</i>, man!


01:34:49.962 --> 01:34:51.664
You are seriously shameless.


01:34:51.664 --> 01:34:52.528
What?


01:34:54.367 --> 01:34:56.736
Look... he is our friend.


01:34:56.736 --> 01:34:58.636
When he is back,
lets talk to him.


01:35:00.907 --> 01:35:01.703
Okay?


01:35:03.643 --> 01:35:04.200
Okay.


01:35:26.666 --> 01:35:27.394
God!


01:35:28.134 --> 01:35:29.192
