we have to do a test.


01:36:02.001 --> 01:36:03.836
- III say a word.
- Okay.


01:36:03.836 --> 01:36:07.897
And you have to say the first thing
that comes to your mind.


01:36:07.974 --> 01:36:09.575
Without deliberating.


01:36:09.575 --> 01:36:10.940
- Alright?
- Okay.


01:36:11.010 --> 01:36:12.671
- Ready, doctor.
- Fine.


01:36:13.112 --> 01:36:14.079
Car.


01:36:14.313 --> 01:36:15.214
Road.


01:36:15.214 --> 01:36:16.181
Arjun.


01:36:16.482 --> 01:36:17.346
Brother.


01:36:17.517 --> 01:36:18.381
Diary.


01:36:18.451 --> 01:36:19.284
Poetry.


01:36:19.285 --> 01:36:20.153
Heart.


01:36:20.153 --> 01:36:20.710
Love.


01:36:20.787 --> 01:36:21.654
Mumbai.


01:36:21.654 --> 01:36:22.522
Traffic.


01:36:22.523 --> 01:36:23.580
Father.


01:36:25.391 --> 01:36:26.358
- Father?
- Mother.


01:36:29.529 --> 01:36:31.588
According to my test...


01:36:31.664 --> 01:36:34.567
your father is the root of
your emotional problem.


01:36:34.567 --> 01:36:36.125
And youre keeping this from the world.


01:36:37.804 --> 01:36:41.073
And, in my opinion,
Dr. Sigmund <i>Fraud</i>...


01:36:41.073 --> 01:36:44.770
its time to shred your degree.
Please stop practicing, please!


01:36:45.044 --> 01:36:46.534
You hurt my feelings, man.


01:36:57.990 --> 01:36:58.786
My <i>bwoys</i>!


01:36:59.725 --> 01:37:02.285
If you want a view,
look that way.


01:37:11.237 --> 01:37:12.898
We should talk to him.


01:37:19.712 --> 01:37:23.049
Natasha is really sweet.
It was really nice to meet her.


01:37:23.049 --> 01:37:26.678
Yeah... even she was glad
to have met you.


01:37:29.722 --> 01:37:30.916
Kabir...


01:37:33.392 --> 01:37:35.792
- are you happy?
- Yes.


01:37:39.999 --> 01:37:42.832
