between Laila and me.


01:38:12.665 --> 01:38:13.563
Yeah.


01:38:14.300 --> 01:38:17.326
But, now theres no problem.
Thanks to you, my <i>bwoys</i>!


01:38:18.404 --> 01:38:19.632
Okay?


01:38:19.705 --> 01:38:20.899
Shes sweet.


01:38:21.407 --> 01:38:23.068
Imran, youve met her.
You spent time with her.


01:38:23.142 --> 01:38:24.006
Tell him.


01:38:24.410 --> 01:38:25.707
Yes, she is very sweet.


01:38:29.815 --> 01:38:31.048
Well thats good, man.


01:38:31.049 --> 01:38:31.880
Im happy for you.


01:38:37.657 --> 01:38:39.181
Hey... heres an extra pillow!


01:38:44.363 --> 01:38:45.523
Good night, <i>bwoys</i>.


01:38:46.732 --> 01:38:47.892
Good night.


01:39:02.715 --> 01:39:06.242
Guys, do you mind
if we take a detour?


01:39:07.286 --> 01:39:08.082
