01:40:57.362 --> 01:40:59.729
With a beautiful instructor
like Laila, who wouldnt!


01:41:00.366 --> 01:41:02.231
You never know,
you also might get lucky.


01:41:02.635 --> 01:41:05.971
You people ready to
