01:41:42.808 --> 01:41:44.332
These are total malfunctions.


01:41:44.844 --> 01:41:47.813
In case of a total malfunction
what you have to do is this.


01:41:47.813 --> 01:41:49.974
Cut away your main and
deploy your reserve.


01:41:50.449 --> 01:41:52.076
What is that?
You have a malfunction.


01:41:54.954 --> 01:41:57.189
Cut away my main and
deploy my reserve.


01:41:57.189 --> 01:41:58.520
What are you doing?


01:41:59.358 --> 01:42:01.883
