01:42:14.874 --> 01:42:15.533
Whats this?


01:42:15.975 --> 01:42:16.907
Waiver form.


01:42:16.908 --> 01:42:17.637
Waiver form?


01:42:17.710 --> 01:42:21.043
If something happens to us... like death,
