01:45:54.626 --> 01:45:55.991
Come on, Imran!


01:45:59.031 --> 01:46:00.157
Imran!


01:48:23.342 --> 01:48:26.869
<i>Who are you?</i>
Where have you been?


01:48:27.513 --> 01:48:30.073
<i>I've moved the heaven and the earth</i>
but I couldn't flnd you.


01:48:31.316 --> 01:48:34.649
<i>But you arrive today</i>,
so suddenly.


01:48:35.220 --> 01:48:38.246
<i>And you give meaning to</i>
my whole life with your love.


01:48:38.957 --> 01:48:40.584
<i>I don't understand.</i>


01:48:41.126 --> 01:48:42.787
<i>I don't know.</i>


01:48:43.161 --> 01:48:46.028
<i>What you've said to me, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:48:46.732 --> 01:48:50.190
<i>Even then, I have no idea why.</i>


01:48:50.969 --> 01:48:54.166
<i>I like what I heard, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:04.683 --> 01:49:07.015
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:49:08.720 --> 01:49:10.881
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:49:12.558 --> 01:49:15.118
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:49:15.694 --> 01:49:18.390
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:19.398 --> 01:49:22.526
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:49:24.136 --> 01:49:27.039
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:49:27.039 --> 01:49:30.167
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:49:31.877 --> 01:49:34.209
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:49:34.279 --> 01:49:38.079
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:49:38.850 --> 01:49:41.978
<i>I will never understand.</i>


01:49:43.021 --> 01:49:46.081
<i>The meaning of the words</i>
you dedicate to me.


01:49:46.625 --> 01:49:49.594
<i>But the warmth of your gaze.</i>


01:49:50.829 --> 01:49:54.060
<i>Makes me feel like</i>
the most beautiful SeÃ±orita.


01:49:54.466 --> 01:49:58.704
<i>Our eyes looked at each other.</i>


01:49:58.704 --> 01:50:01.605
<i>And recounted tales of desire SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:02.307 --> 01:50:06.107
<i>That for affection and for love.</i>


01:50:06.345 --> 01:50:10.645
<i>There is only one language</i>
in the world SeÃ±orita.


01:50:11.149 --> 01:50:13.549
<i>Don't look away from me now.</i>


01:50:15.020 --> 01:50:17.181
<i>Come closer to me.</i>


01:50:18.790 --> 01:50:21.623
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:50:22.060 --> 01:50:25.393
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:25.464 --> 01:50:28.922
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:50:30.469 --> 01:50:32.835
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:50:33.405 --> 01:50:37.205
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:50:38.310 --> 01:50:40.679
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:50:40.679 --> 01:50:45.048
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:50:53.492 --> 01:50:55.983
<i>With every moment that has passed.</i>


01:50:57.996 --> 01:51:00.191
<i>Oh SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:01.900 --> 01:51:04.733
<i>You've managed to win my heart.</i>


01:51:05.137 --> 01:51:07.002
<i>And that's all there is to it.</i>


01:51:07.706 --> 01:51:09.731
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:51:11.643 --> 01:51:13.804
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:51:15.347 --> 01:51:17.713
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:51:18.684 --> 01:51:21.676
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:22.154 --> 01:51:25.180
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:51:27.059 --> 01:51:29.084
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:51:29.961 --> 01:51:33.488
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:51:34.866 --> 01:51:37.198
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:52:16.675 --> 01:52:19.439
Remember before cable TV
we only had one national channel?


01:52:21.680 --> 01:52:24.205
And every Sunday
they showed a Hindi film.


01:52:25.617 --> 01:52:27.244
Get to the point.


01:52:28.720 --> 01:52:29.744
The point is...


01:52:30.622 --> 01:52:32.681
before the film there was this animation.


01:52:33.725 --> 01:52:36.216
A white circle went round and round
and formed the channel logo.


01:52:38.830 --> 01:52:40.024
Do you remember the tune?


01:53:00.218 --> 01:53:01.048
Brilliant!


01:53:12.798 --> 01:53:15.096
That tune never failed to depress me.


01:53:16.168 --> 01:53:17.157
Depressed.


01:53:18.904 --> 01:53:20.599
Im feeling the same right now.


01:53:23.742 --> 01:53:25.835
Weekends over and school begins.


01:53:26.278 --> 01:53:29.214
- And you wanted to cancel this trip!
- I know, man!


01:53:29.214 --> 01:53:30.442
Can you imagine?


01:53:34.452 --> 01:53:35.578
You know what that means?


01:53:37.055 --> 01:53:38.283
It means...


01:53:39.457 --> 01:53:41.618
that everything is predestined.


01:53:44.296 --> 01:53:45.354
Everything!


01:53:46.464 --> 01:53:49.922
This holiday was in our destiny.


01:53:51.136 --> 01:53:52.103
You know!


01:53:54.906 --> 01:53:56.703
You, me and asshole.


01:53:58.009 --> 01:53:59.670
- Cheers asshole.
- Wheres asshole?


01:54:01.813 --> 01:54:02.336
Cheers!


01:54:05.217 --> 01:54:06.707
Laila too.


01:54:10.789 --> 01:54:12.916
I was meant to meet her.


01:54:14.226 --> 01:54:15.591
You are in <i>louw</i>, my <i>bwoy</i>.


01:54:16.394 --> 01:54:17.520
No, man!


01:54:18.029 --> 01:54:19.394
You are in louw...


01:54:20.131 --> 01:54:21.399
You are in louw...


01:54:21.400 --> 01:54:24.266
- You are in <i>louw...</i>
- Kabir, man!


01:54:24.336 --> 01:54:26.702
Everything is written.
Listen to me.


01:54:26.905 --> 01:54:28.395
Its all predestined.


01:54:28.640 --> 01:54:29.474
You know what Im saying?


01:54:29.475 --> 01:54:31.642
This moment... us right now...


01:54:31.643 --> 01:54:33.111
its predestined.


01:54:33.111 --> 01:54:34.669
Predestined.


01:54:35.447 --> 01:54:37.472
Please stop saying, predestined...!


01:54:37.782 --> 01:54:39.306
I beg of you!


01:54:39.784 --> 01:54:42.319
This too is predestined.
Its all written.


01:54:42.320 --> 01:54:44.322
Alright, we get it.


01:54:44.322 --> 01:54:46.222
Listen, we get it, zip!


01:54:46.291 --> 01:54:47.451
Come on, man!


01:54:49.160 --> 01:54:50.127
Its true.


01:54:51.229 --> 01:54:52.397
Its predestined...


01:54:52.398 --> 01:54:53.295
Guys...


01:55:04.976 --> 01:55:05.840
Hola...


01:55:18.290 --> 01:55:19.780
Guys, watch out!


01:55:22.560 --> 01:55:23.618
What the hell, guys?


01:55:30.502 --> 01:55:31.298
Yes?


01:55:46.851 --> 01:55:49.721
- Our man is back.
- Their mobiles are switched off.


01:55:49.721 --> 01:55:50.710
- What?
- Yup.


01:55:50.789 --> 01:55:51.890
Even Nurias?


01:55:51.890 --> 01:55:53.448
Yes, Im shocked.


01:55:53.525 --> 01:55:56.585
When she knew wed land up in jail,
she shouldve kept the phone switched on.


01:55:57.963 --> 01:55:59.965
If our bail isnt posted...


01:55:59.965 --> 01:56:02.490
well be stuck here for days.


01:56:07.138 --> 01:56:08.002
Arjun...


01:56:09.674 --> 01:56:11.471
tell them I want to make a call.


01:56:12.510 --> 01:56:13.636
To whom?


01:56:14.713 --> 01:56:15.941
Salman Habib.


01:56:16.448 --> 01:56:17.472
The artist?


01:56:19.317 --> 01:56:20.011
Yeah.


01:56:21.386 --> 01:56:23.183
Why will he come to post our bail?


01:56:24.956 --> 01:56:26.116
Are you alright?


01:56:26.992 --> 01:56:29.394
Just because we cant reach anyone,
hes losing it.


01:56:29.395 --> 01:56:30.452
Hes my father.


01:56:31.329 --> 01:56:32.023
What?


01:56:34.499 --> 01:56:35.625
I am his son.


01:56:45.977 --> 01:56:47.171
Just let it go Imran.


01:56:49.848 --> 01:56:50.906
Just let it go.


01:56:51.483 --> 01:56:52.142
Hello...


01:56:53.518 --> 01:56:54.886
Hello, may I...


01:56:54.886 --> 01:56:57.047
speak with Mr. Salman Habib, please?


01:56:57.789 --> 01:56:58.517
Yes?


01:57:00.158 --> 01:57:01.887
Sir, I am Imran.


01:57:03.828 --> 01:57:06.319
I am Rahilas son.


01:57:10.635 --> 01:57:12.102
When did you find out?


01:57:15.407 --> 01:57:17.307
Afew days after Abu died.


01:57:20.111 --> 01:57:23.569
In his stuff, I found a letter
that Ammi had written to him.


01:57:25.016 --> 01:57:26.745
The letter stated that...


01:57:26.818 --> 01:57:32.518
Ammi was grateful that Abu had
accepted her and her unborn child.


01:57:35.860 --> 01:57:37.418
Why didn't you tell us?


01:57:40.465 --> 01:57:41.796
I was a bit shaken up.


01:57:43.535 --> 01:57:46.060
What would I tell you?
<i>Abu is not my father.</i>


01:57:48.706 --> 01:57:50.674
He loved you a lot.


01:57:52.210 --> 01:57:53.837
He really loved you.


01:57:55.780 --> 01:57:57.111
And us.


01:57:57.816 --> 01:57:59.817
I mean, think about it.


01:57:59.818 --> 01:58:02.353
Be it sports day or
parent-teacher meetings...


01:58:02.353 --> 01:58:05.686
our fathers seldom came,
but Abu was always there.


01:58:07.325 --> 01:58:09.520
Well, my father was dead.


01:58:10.028 --> 01:58:13.361
So, if he showed up for sports day
it wouldve been a bit strange.


01:58:20.305 --> 01:58:21.704
Youve got bail.


01:58:24.976 --> 01:58:26.273
Theyre here.


01:58:37.989 --> 01:58:38.853
Hi.


01:58:41.893 --> 01:58:42.689
Imran.


01:58:44.896 --> 01:58:45.863
Imran...


01:58:47.132 --> 01:58:47.996
Im Salman.


01:58:52.670 --> 01:58:54.739
My friends, Arjun and Kabir.


01:58:54.739 --> 01:58:55.933
- Hello.
- Thank you.


01:58:56.007 --> 01:58:57.304
Hi... thank you.


01:58:58.243 --> 01:59:00.234
You three look pretty hungover.


01:59:03.548 --> 01:59:06.346
Youre welcome to come over to
my place and freshen up.


01:59:07.018 --> 01:59:09.748
Our bags and car are at the hotel.


01:59:09.954 --> 01:59:11.353
III drive you there.


01:59:13.191 --> 01:59:13.885
Come.


01:59:28.873 --> 01:59:30.898
Wow, this is beautiful.


01:59:32.644 --> 01:59:33.668
Its really nice.


01:59:34.879 --> 01:59:37.074
Are you always so polite?


01:59:38.550 --> 01:59:41.849
Its absolute rubbish.
Anyone can do that.


01:59:42.654 --> 01:59:45.155
This gentleman, my neighbour...


01:59:45.156 --> 01:59:48.359
was obsessed with having his wife
immortalised in a potrait.


01:59:48.359 --> 01:59:51.886
So, I applied my brush
and fulfilled his desire.


01:59:51.963 --> 01:59:54.295
And with his money, paid my bills.


01:59:56.668 --> 01:59:59.000
So, what are you guys doing in Seville?


01:59:59.704 --> 02:00:01.072
Skydiving.


02:00:01.072 --> 02:00:02.232
- Really?
- Yeah.


02:00:02.307 --> 02:00:04.434
So, you jumped out of a plane
and landed in jail?


02:00:05.710 --> 02:00:07.075
You could say that.


02:00:07.545 --> 02:00:11.675
That apart, what do you do?


02:00:12.650 --> 02:00:14.277
Well, Im a financial broker.


02:00:14.652 --> 02:00:15.619
In London.


02:00:16.120 --> 02:00:17.178
Money man.


02:00:18.623 --> 02:00:19.351
And you?


02:00:19.991 --> 02:00:21.686
My family is in the construction business.


02:00:22.727 --> 02:00:25.093
Well, never mind.
Everyone makes mistakes.


02:00:26.064 --> 02:00:26.860
Thats funny.


02:00:27.498 --> 02:00:29.489
Youre a Xerox copy of him.


02:00:33.204 --> 02:00:34.899
And, what about you?


02:00:36.307 --> 02:00:37.205
I write.


02:00:38.876 --> 02:00:39.433
What?


02:00:40.311 --> 02:00:42.040
Im a copywriter in advertising.


02:00:43.114 --> 02:00:46.174
Writing copy for ads is like
a buffet for the masses.


02:00:46.551 --> 02:00:49.247
For instance, this painting is
for someone else.


02:00:50.688 --> 02:00:53.486
Do you write anything
to feed your own soul?


02:00:55.193 --> 02:00:56.524
I do.


02:01:01.332 --> 02:01:02.132
Sir?


02:01:02.200 --> 02:01:03.030
Salman.


02:01:03.735 --> 02:01:05.464
Right. Well be outside.


02:01:22.954 --> 02:01:26.117
Your hands are very similar to mine.


02:01:29.527 --> 02:01:30.494
Sit.


02:01:34.232 --> 02:01:35.130
Do you live alone?


02:01:35.633 --> 02:01:36.600
No.


02:01:37.302 --> 02:01:38.166
I have a wife.


02:01:38.536 --> 02:01:40.663
But she is away... in Paris.


02:01:41.172 --> 02:01:41.866
Sit.


02:01:44.976 --> 02:01:45.908
And any...


02:01:46.144 --> 02:01:47.304
children?


02:01:53.885 --> 02:01:55.113
Do you ever come to India?


02:01:56.154 --> 02:01:57.221
Yes.


02:01:57.221 --> 02:02:00.088
I was there four years ago
when my mother passed away.


02:02:01.459 --> 02:02:03.161
- Sorry.
- I have a brother there...


02:02:03.162 --> 02:02:04.128
but...


02:02:05.730 --> 02:02:07.027
we don't meet.


02:02:12.637 --> 02:02:15.003
Ive often thought about you.


02:02:16.974 --> 02:02:17.998
I mean...


02:02:19.477 --> 02:02:23.937
that someday, somewhere we might meet.


02:02:25.616 --> 02:02:28.052
But I never figured...


02:02:28.052 --> 02:02:30.612
what I would say to you.


02:02:32.290 --> 02:02:33.450
Just say the truth.


02:02:36.227 --> 02:02:38.422
The truth... what is the truth?


02:02:39.664 --> 02:02:42.224
Everyone has their own version.


02:02:47.572 --> 02:02:49.741
Look... I was...


02:02:49.741 --> 02:02:51.606
25 then.


02:02:52.777 --> 02:02:55.746
Rahila was a few years younger.


02:02:57.148 --> 02:02:59.884
When youre young
the future doesn't matter.


02:02:59.884 --> 02:03:01.511
We were just kids.


02:03:04.155 --> 02:03:06.214
One day...


02:03:06.290 --> 02:03:08.781
Rahila told me that shes...


02:03:09.394 --> 02:03:12.261
expecting a baby.


02:03:12.330 --> 02:03:15.231
I wasnt ready for
the responsibility then.


02:03:15.299 --> 02:03:17.199
And nor am I now.


02:03:23.708 --> 02:03:26.643
So... you just abandoned her?


02:03:30.515 --> 02:03:33.507
I guess, you could say that.


02:03:38.689 --> 02:03:43.217
Rahila wanted a family,
she wanted to be a mother.


02:03:44.529 --> 02:03:47.157
I had other dreams.
I wanted to be an artist.


02:03:48.166 --> 02:03:50.168
I wanted to paint...


02:03:50.168 --> 02:03:51.635
travel the world.


02:03:53.171 --> 02:03:55.573
I loved her but...


02:03:55.573 --> 02:03:58.599
she made her choice
and I made mine.


02:03:58.676 --> 02:04:00.473
Thats all.


02:04:04.382 --> 02:04:06.612
I found out about you
only last year.


02:04:10.555 --> 02:04:11.522
But...


02:04:13.224 --> 02:04:15.852
youve always known about me.


02:04:17.695 --> 02:04:20.357
Did you never want to see me?


02:04:22.500 --> 02:04:24.400
I thought it was better this way.


02:04:32.376 --> 02:04:34.867
You asked for the truth.


02:04:36.280 --> 02:04:37.406
Well, this is it.


02:04:40.151 --> 02:04:41.516
I... am sorry, Imran.


02:04:43.454 --> 02:04:44.478
No, youre not.


02:04:49.393 --> 02:04:51.793
Is there something
I can do for you?


02:04:53.364 --> 02:04:56.356
Apologise only when it comes from here.


02:05:19.624 --> 02:05:22.593
<i>When clouds of pain loom in the sky.</i>


02:05:23.294 --> 02:05:26.263
<i>When a shadow of sadness flickers by.</i>


02:05:27.064 --> 02:05:30.033
<i>When a tear flnds it's way to the eye.</i>


02:05:30.401 --> 02:05:33.370
<i>When fear keeps the loneliness alive.</i>


02:05:34.372 --> 02:05:39.010
<i>I try and console my heart</i>
Why is it that you cry? I ask.


02:05:39.010 --> 02:05:41.535
<i>This is only what life imparts.</i>


02:05:42.280 --> 02:05:44.680
<i>These deep silences within.</i>


02:05:45.182 --> 02:05:47.810
<i>Have been handed out to all by time.</i>


02:05:49.053 --> 02:05:51.544
<i>Everyone's story has a little sorrow.</i>


02:05:52.123 --> 02:05:54.785
<i>Everyone's share has a little Sunshine.</i>


02:05:56.160 --> 02:05:58.219
<i>No need for water in your eyes.</i>


02:05:59.630 --> 02:06:01.928
<i>Every moment can be a new life.</i>


02:06:03.334 --> 02:06:05.529
<i>Why do you let them pass you by.</i>


02:06:07.004 --> 02:06:08.972
<i>Oh heart, why is it that you cry?</i>


02:06:18.215 --> 02:06:19.375
Morning...


02:06:25.623 --> 02:06:26.647
Did you sleep or not?


02:06:28.292 --> 02:06:29.020
No.


02:06:38.202 --> 02:06:40.830
I think, we should get going.


02:06:42.540 --> 02:06:43.529
Lets go.


02:06:44.976 --> 02:06:45.601
Arjun...


02:06:49.780 --> 02:06:51.611
Im really sorry.


02:07:16.507 --> 02:07:17.565
III see you at the car.


02:07:17.808 --> 02:07:18.638
Yeah.


02:07:22.780 --> 02:07:24.680
What do you mean,
you slept in the car?


02:07:25.449 --> 02:07:26.746
Long story, babe.


02:07:27.818 --> 02:07:28.842
Tell me, what happened?


02:07:30.121 --> 02:07:32.089
Well, Imran just...


02:07:34.025 --> 02:07:35.185
III tell you later, okay.


02:07:36.060 --> 02:07:37.789
Why? Tell me now,
what happened?


02:07:38.129 --> 02:07:41.098
I cant tell you right now.
III tell you when Im back.


02:07:41.465 --> 02:07:42.932
Why are you getting irritated?


02:07:43.200 --> 02:07:45.065
Why are you going on about it?


02:07:45.302 --> 02:07:46.599
Okay, forget it.


02:07:51.042 --> 02:07:51.974
See.


02:07:52.343 --> 02:07:53.970
Its our wedding card.
Can you see it?


02:07:54.378 --> 02:07:55.777
Isnt it gorgeous?


02:07:56.313 --> 02:07:57.940
Im just so happy with it.


02:07:58.783 --> 02:08:01.385
Oh... Ive emailed a few options
for your suit.


02:08:01.385 --> 02:08:04.081
Please select one. Okay?
Dont forget.


02:08:04.555 --> 02:08:05.453
Okay.


02:08:07.692 --> 02:08:09.887
You are so far away.


02:08:11.195 --> 02:08:12.662
You love me, right?


02:08:14.031 --> 02:08:14.998
Yeah.


02:08:15.700 --> 02:08:17.565
Then stop fighting with me.


02:08:18.402 --> 02:08:21.530
Everything was fine before you
went on this holiday.


02:08:22.206 --> 02:08:24.003
Kabir, just come home.


02:08:24.508 --> 02:08:27.944
To me, your family, your friends.


02:08:28.345 --> 02:08:30.142
My friends are with me.


02:08:30.448 --> 02:08:32.416
Yeah, I know.
But you know what I mean.


02:08:43.994 --> 02:08:50.900
Happy birthday to you...


02:08:51.869 --> 02:08:55.498
Happy birthday dear Anjali...


02:08:56.173 --> 02:08:58.698
Happy birthday to you...


02:09:05.349 --> 02:09:06.247
Oh my God!


02:09:07.284 --> 02:09:08.478
Its beautiful!


02:09:08.853 --> 02:09:09.911
- Nice, right?
- Yes!


02:09:12.022 --> 02:09:12.886
Tanya?


02:09:23.033 --> 02:09:24.193
What are you doing, baby?


02:09:24.802 --> 02:09:26.201
Im sorry, Im so happy.


02:09:26.670 --> 02:09:28.900
Kabir just proposed to Natasha.


02:09:28.973 --> 02:09:30.206
What??


02:09:30.207 --> 02:09:32.208
Oh my God!


02:09:32.209 --> 02:09:34.879
You couldve waited until
your mother had cut the cake.


02:09:34.879 --> 02:09:37.871
Kabir, this is the best
birthday gift, ever!


02:09:37.948 --> 02:09:39.049
I love you, son.


02:09:39.050 --> 02:09:40.107
The shy guy!


02:09:40.785 --> 02:09:42.887
Its a double celebration.


02:09:42.887 --> 02:09:44.354
Im so happy.


02:09:45.122 --> 02:09:46.111
Now you have to call me mummy.


02:09:47.625 --> 02:09:49.490
Get some champagne!


02:09:52.196 --> 02:09:53.196
Come here.


02:09:55.199 --> 02:09:56.598
Very good decision.


02:09:58.836 --> 02:10:00.804
Im so happy.


02:10:02.072 --> 02:10:04.597
Babe, what just happened in there?


02:10:04.675 --> 02:10:06.973
- What do you mean?
- I mean...


02:10:07.478 --> 02:10:09.213
This ring...


02:10:09.213 --> 02:10:10.612
I got it for my mom.


02:10:12.616 --> 02:10:14.413
Its her birthday gift.


02:10:15.019 --> 02:10:16.077
This is for your mom?


02:10:16.720 --> 02:10:19.587
Look at it sweety...
its a mummy ring.


02:10:19.657 --> 02:10:21.058
What?


02:10:21.058 --> 02:10:22.423
Why didn't you say something?


02:10:22.893 --> 02:10:24.417
I tried.


02:10:24.495 --> 02:10:28.397
But you were excited and screaming.
And Tanya made an announcement.


02:10:29.066 --> 02:10:31.227
So you don't want to marry me?


02:10:31.669 --> 02:10:35.196
Its not about you.
I havent even thought about marriage.


02:10:37.875 --> 02:10:39.672
What do I tell my father?


02:10:44.648 --> 02:10:47.551
Well say that
we gave it some more thought and...


02:10:47.551 --> 02:10:49.951
we need more time. Thats all.


02:10:50.020 --> 02:10:51.647
This is so embarrassing.


02:10:52.489 --> 02:10:54.548
Im so sorry, sweety.


02:10:55.492 --> 02:10:58.188
You don't ever want to marry me?


02:10:59.463 --> 02:11:01.298
Its not like that.


02:11:01.298 --> 02:11:03.823
If it is, you better tell me right now!


02:11:05.135 --> 02:11:07.838
I really love you, Kabir.
And I don't...


02:11:07.838 --> 02:11:11.069
No, no... no sweety. Dont cry.


02:11:11.141 --> 02:11:12.073
Not now.


02:11:19.450 --> 02:11:20.178
Kabir...


02:11:22.119 --> 02:11:25.816
are you even serious
about this relationship or not?


02:11:29.159 --> 02:11:29.989
You know what...


02:11:41.038 --> 02:11:42.062
Will you marry me?


02:12:06.196 --> 02:12:07.254
Who is it?


02:12:22.146 --> 02:12:23.010
Room service.


02:12:24.214 --> 02:12:24.839
Laila?


02:12:25.883 --> 02:12:26.907
Hi!


02:12:26.984 --> 02:12:27.814
Oh my God!


02:12:29.219 --> 02:12:30.686
Youre here... how... I mean...


02:12:31.121 --> 02:12:33.817
Imran called and
he begged me to come.


02:12:34.158 --> 02:12:35.352
- So I came.
- Imran?


02:12:35.826 --> 02:12:36.850
I knew it.


02:12:37.528 --> 02:12:39.086
He is my best friend.


02:12:42.232 --> 02:12:44.393
I am... so glad youre here.


02:12:45.836 --> 02:12:47.497
Im glad you are glad.


02:12:50.174 --> 02:12:52.335
Hello... my <i>the</i> two <i>the</i> love <i>the</i> birds!


02:12:52.810 --> 02:12:54.141
Hello!


02:12:54.278 --> 02:12:55.336
Surprised, Arjun?


02:12:56.647 --> 02:12:57.705
Thank you.


02:12:57.781 --> 02:12:59.183
Its good to see you.


02:12:59.183 --> 02:13:00.377
- And you.
- Hey gorgeous.


02:13:00.451 --> 02:13:02.519
- I love you too.
- Nice to have you back.


02:13:02.519 --> 02:13:03.884
You got a tan!


02:13:04.655 --> 02:13:05.654
Get dressed, soon!


02:13:05.655 --> 02:13:06.989
- We had to leave at seven.
- Correct.


02:13:06.990 --> 02:13:08.192
- Two minutes?
- You missed me?


02:13:08.193 --> 02:13:09.860
I always miss you, darling.


02:13:09.860 --> 02:13:10.884
Where are we going?


02:13:10.961 --> 02:13:12.588
Its a surprise.
Cant tell you in front of him.


02:13:30.647 --> 02:13:31.807
Whats going on?


02:13:32.216 --> 02:13:33.274
What do you mean?


02:13:33.517 --> 02:13:34.575
Its San Fermin.


02:13:34.651 --> 02:13:35.684
Running with the bulls.


02:13:35.685 --> 02:13:37.085
- Really?
- Didnt you know?


02:13:37.154 --> 02:13:38.280
Just follow me...


02:13:46.563 --> 02:13:47.621
Holy shit!


02:13:54.671 --> 02:13:56.298
Are these guys mad?
What are they doing?


02:13:56.540 --> 02:13:57.336
Suicide.


02:13:57.875 --> 02:13:59.240
Isnt that why you are here?


02:14:09.953 --> 02:14:12.012
I felt this should be the
last experience of our trip.


02:14:12.723 --> 02:14:15.191
This could be the
<i>last</i> experience of our life!


02:14:15.526 --> 02:14:17.694
Stop it, Arjun.
Lets grab a bite.


02:14:17.694 --> 02:14:18.251
Come on.


02:14:19.329 --> 02:14:20.397
- Excuse me.
- Dude are you...


02:14:20.398 --> 02:14:21.625
Im starving!


02:14:23.233 --> 02:14:24.723
This is not an adventure sport.


02:14:25.402 --> 02:14:26.699
I object, Judge <i>sahab</i>!


02:14:27.337 --> 02:14:29.505
I agree its not as safe as regular sports.


02:14:29.506 --> 02:14:31.075
And is illegal in some countries.


02:14:31.075 --> 02:14:33.873
But according to the
Spanish tradition and culture...


02:14:33.944 --> 02:14:34.876
it is allowed.


02:14:34.877 --> 02:14:36.869
And technically,
according to our deal...


02:14:36.947 --> 02:14:39.347
we can choose any sport, remember?


02:14:39.683 --> 02:14:41.185
Imran, its really dangerous, you know.


02:14:41.186 --> 02:14:43.380
Yes, those bulls could kill us, alright?


02:14:43.620 --> 02:14:46.290
Well be dangling on their horns
like tandoori chicken on skewers!


02:14:46.290 --> 02:14:48.019
Precisely the point.


02:14:49.159 --> 02:14:51.218
You want to get rid of
the fear within you?


02:14:51.495 --> 02:14:53.656
Well then, heres
our deepest fear. Death.


02:14:54.698 --> 02:14:55.722
Lets face it.


02:14:56.333 --> 02:14:57.699
Because beyond this fear...


02:14:57.700 --> 02:14:58.599
lies victory!


02:14:58.669 --> 02:15:00.694
Please spare us the tag lines!


02:15:01.138 --> 02:15:02.833
Dude, think about it!


02:15:03.073 --> 02:15:06.702
No training, no instructors.
Just us, my amigos!


02:15:07.444 --> 02:15:09.241
And some bulls running after us.


02:15:09.480 --> 02:15:11.778
If you want to live... just run!


02:15:12.182 --> 02:15:14.343
Laila, do you know
any psychiatrist around here?


02:15:15.119 --> 02:15:17.349
Because our amigo has
completely lost it!


02:15:18.188 --> 02:15:20.213
III be at the starting line
at seven tomorrow morning.


02:15:20.858 --> 02:15:22.826
With or without you.


02:15:28.365 --> 02:15:28.763
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:28.764 --> 02:15:29.754
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:30.634 --> 02:15:31.464
Its from Nuria.


02:15:35.239 --> 02:15:36.035
Its in Spanish.


02:15:37.007 --> 02:15:38.269
Love has no language.


02:15:38.876 --> 02:15:39.570
So true.


02:15:42.613 --> 02:15:43.944
I think you should
buy her something.


02:15:44.781 --> 02:15:45.611
Youre absolutely right.


02:15:46.183 --> 02:15:47.741
Guys... next stop - shopping.


02:15:49.186 --> 02:15:50.744
Count me out,
Im going back to the hotel.


02:15:51.822 --> 02:15:52.948
Are you alright?


02:15:55.325 --> 02:15:56.155
Im fine.


02:15:57.027 --> 02:15:58.995
That well only know after a test.


02:15:59.863 --> 02:16:00.659
Test?


02:16:01.899 --> 02:16:03.127
What do you say, Dr. <i>Fraud?</i>.


02:16:04.034 --> 02:16:04.728
Are you game?


02:16:05.335 --> 02:16:06.063
Bring it on.


02:16:06.737 --> 02:16:07.931
You have to say the first thing...


02:16:08.005 --> 02:16:09.973
I know the drill. Ask!


02:16:10.874 --> 02:16:11.602
Black.


02:16:11.842 --> 02:16:12.399
Night.


02:16:12.476 --> 02:16:13.340
Sea.


02:16:13.510 --> 02:16:14.238
Salty.


02:16:14.311 --> 02:16:15.144
Work.


02:16:15.145 --> 02:16:16.146
Money.


02:16:16.146 --> 02:16:17.010
Sex.


02:16:17.214 --> 02:16:18.048
I like!


02:16:18.048 --> 02:16:18.571
Friend.


02:16:18.949 --> 02:16:19.677
You.


02:16:19.883 --> 02:16:20.850
Marriage.


02:16:22.186 --> 02:16:23.346
Family.


02:16:30.194 --> 02:16:31.024
What?


02:16:32.829 --> 02:16:34.331
Is that all?


02:16:34.331 --> 02:16:35.628
It was enough.


02:16:37.501 --> 02:16:39.169
Smartass...


02:16:39.169 --> 02:16:42.866
Youre using my trick on me?
Just say what you want to.


02:16:43.407 --> 02:16:44.305
Okay.


02:16:45.042 --> 02:16:47.442
You hesitated on marriage.


02:16:47.878 --> 02:16:49.277
So?


02:16:49.346 --> 02:16:52.804
Im just saying...
you hesitated... on marriage.


02:16:56.787 --> 02:16:57.651
Look...


02:16:58.655 --> 02:17:02.182
I don't have the time for this crap.
See you later.


02:17:05.963 --> 02:17:08.591
- Okay.
- Im sorry, Im going to...


02:17:16.506 --> 02:17:17.473
Kabir.


02:17:22.613 --> 02:17:23.409
Go!


02:17:26.316 --> 02:17:27.442
Kabir!


02:17:28.452 --> 02:17:29.919
Kabir... man, just stop!


02:17:30.621 --> 02:17:31.747
What?


02:17:32.856 --> 02:17:34.721
Talk to us man. Whats going on?


02:17:35.125 --> 02:17:36.990
Its nothing, really.


02:17:38.962 --> 02:17:39.929
Kabir...


02:17:41.898 --> 02:17:44.196
Look, Im sorry I lost my cool.


02:17:45.502 --> 02:17:47.834
Because I said you have
a problem with marriage?


02:17:48.705 --> 02:17:51.970
I guess, Im freaking out.
I don't know whats happening.


02:17:52.376 --> 02:17:54.710
Its normal to be nervous.


02:17:54.711 --> 02:17:57.214
Its not like youre having
an arranged marriage.


02:17:57.214 --> 02:17:59.876
Yeah, but she isnt
the same person I met.


02:18:00.550 --> 02:18:02.711
Shes changed,
shes become possessive.


02:18:03.320 --> 02:18:06.619
The girl I knew was a
talented, independent interior designer.


02:18:06.790 --> 02:18:08.825
She enjoyed her work.


02:18:08.825 --> 02:18:09.792
But now...


02:18:10.360 --> 02:18:12.328
shes bid adieu to her passion and...


02:18:12.562 --> 02:18:14.462
taken over my life.


02:18:15.399 --> 02:18:17.401
Of course, I want a partner but...


02:18:17.401 --> 02:18:19.096
I want my own life too!


02:18:19.403 --> 02:18:23.203
The whole <i>two bodies, one soul</i> thing
I wont be able to handle it.


02:18:33.884 --> 02:18:35.875
- May I ask you something?
- Yes.


02:18:37.187 --> 02:18:39.417
Dont you think
you proposed to her too soon?


02:18:40.157 --> 02:18:42.325
Actually, I didn't even propose.


02:18:42.326 --> 02:18:43.894
What?


02:18:43.894 --> 02:18:46.226
Id bought a ring for my mom
as a birthday gift.


02:18:46.496 --> 02:18:49.897
Before giving it, I happened to show
it to Natasha and she thought...


02:18:50.334 --> 02:18:51.801
it was meant for her.


02:18:53.570 --> 02:18:55.265
- Are you crazy?
- What are you doing?


02:18:55.739 --> 02:18:57.536
- Whats wrong with him?
- What's wrong with him?


02:19:02.846 --> 02:19:05.212
No wonder this vacation was
so important for you.


02:19:05.949 --> 02:19:06.608
Meaning?


02:19:07.718 --> 02:19:10.949
Basically, you wanted to hear from someone
else that you shouldn't get married.


02:19:11.154 --> 02:19:13.856
And besides us,
who wouldve told you this.


02:19:13.857 --> 02:19:15.726
Have you totally lost it?


02:19:15.726 --> 02:19:18.388
The invites are printed.
This isnt the time to overreact!


02:19:19.363 --> 02:19:20.330
Kabir.


02:19:21.865 --> 02:19:23.526
We know Natasha is a great girl.


02:19:23.800 --> 02:19:25.768
And we know you like her.


02:19:26.303 --> 02:19:27.793
And of course,
you don't want to hurt her.


02:19:28.839 --> 02:19:31.808
But ask yourself...
Do you really want to marry her?


02:19:32.542 --> 02:19:34.203
And if not, be honest.


02:19:34.277 --> 02:19:35.767
To yourself and to her.


02:19:36.480 --> 02:19:39.381
Of course, shell be hurt.
But in the long run its best for both of you.


02:19:39.549 --> 02:19:41.176
He is absolutely right, Kabir.


02:19:41.451 --> 02:19:43.248
But Ive made a commitment.


02:19:43.620 --> 02:19:45.355
Okay, you screwed up.


02:19:45.355 --> 02:19:47.380
No ones going to send you to prison.


02:19:47.457 --> 02:19:50.017
Its not that simple.
Our parents are involved.


02:19:50.227 --> 02:19:51.057
Parents?


02:19:51.495 --> 02:19:52.621
Dude, its your life.


02:19:55.699 --> 02:19:57.030
You wont get it.


02:19:58.201 --> 02:19:59.031
Just...


02:19:59.703 --> 02:20:01.864
Just let it be, okay? Im sorry.


02:20:02.706 --> 02:20:03.832
Kabir...


02:20:07.611 --> 02:20:08.578
What a guy!


02:20:26.830 --> 02:20:27.854
Laila?


02:20:31.802 --> 02:20:32.826
Why're you shouting?


02:20:33.904 --> 02:20:35.531
Why are you so far?


02:20:49.820 --> 02:20:50.718
Better?


02:20:52.055 --> 02:20:52.885
Best.


02:20:55.959 --> 02:20:56.687
Ammi?


02:20:57.828 --> 02:20:59.295
How are you?


02:21:02.199 --> 02:21:04.167
I met Salman.


02:21:10.540 --> 02:21:13.566
I now know why you and Abu
kept this from me.


02:21:17.180 --> 02:21:18.238
Im sorry, Ammi.


02:21:21.184 --> 02:21:22.242
I love you.


02:21:24.020 --> 02:21:25.544
I love you too, my boy.


02:22:01.858 --> 02:22:05.316
<i>It took a while but.</i>


02:22:10.233 --> 02:22:14.636
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:19.109 --> 02:22:22.806
<i>Without the consolation of tears.</i>


02:22:27.484 --> 02:22:32.148
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:52.042 --> 02:22:58.715
<i>There is someone who brought to mind.</i>


02:22:58.715 --> 02:23:03.277
<i>How I had gotten left behind.</i>


02:23:05.021 --> 02:23:10.687
<i>Life is like a caravan.</i>


02:23:11.828 --> 02:23:15.787
<i>Why are you lonely, my man.</i>


02:23:18.201 --> 02:23:22.661
<i>Just know that we are all here.</i>


02:23:45.862 --> 02:23:48.922
The first rocket indicates that
the pen gates have been opened.


02:23:49.332 --> 02:23:51.800
Second rocket indicates that
the bulls are coming towards us.


02:23:52.135 --> 02:23:53.837
We run at the second rocket.


02:23:53.837 --> 02:23:54.701
Second rocket.


02:23:56.339 --> 02:23:57.897
Oh San Fermin, please protect us.


02:23:59.843 --> 02:24:01.174
If I die...


02:24:01.544 --> 02:24:03.273
my spirit will come back to haunt you.


02:24:03.713 --> 02:24:05.237
Why are you thinking about death?


02:24:05.315 --> 02:24:07.283
Think about what youll do
if you survive.


02:24:11.855 --> 02:24:12.855
Listen...


02:24:13.023 --> 02:24:13.921
a new pact.


02:24:14.791 --> 02:24:16.486
An if-I-get out-alive pact.


02:24:17.661 --> 02:24:20.221
If I get out alive,
III let you read my poetry.


02:24:21.398 --> 02:24:22.899
Why just you? III just...


02:24:22.899 --> 02:24:24.093
get it published.


02:24:24.968 --> 02:24:25.935
You write poetry?


02:24:26.169 --> 02:24:26.999
Yes.


02:24:28.805 --> 02:24:29.772
Okay.


02:24:30.073 --> 02:24:31.904
If I get out alive...


02:24:34.978 --> 02:24:35.672
Okay!


02:24:36.146 --> 02:24:37.980
If I get out alive...


02:24:37.981 --> 02:24:40.016
III go to Morocco with Laila.


02:24:40.016 --> 02:24:40.846
Yeah!


02:24:41.184 --> 02:24:42.208
Thats what III do.


02:24:42.619 --> 02:24:44.786
Whats the worst that could happen?
III get fired.


02:24:44.787 --> 02:24:45.789
- Right?
- Yeah.


02:24:45.790 --> 02:24:46.990
Who cares man?


02:24:46.990 --> 02:24:48.184
III be with her and I will live.


02:24:48.558 --> 02:24:49.718
Well done, my bro!


02:24:50.727 --> 02:24:51.557
Come on, Kabir.


02:24:53.963 --> 02:24:54.631
Okay.


02:24:54.632 --> 02:24:56.326
If I get out alive...


02:25:00.470 --> 02:25:02.028
Shit guys! The gates are open!


02:25:02.372 --> 02:25:03.430
Kabir just say it.


02:25:03.506 --> 02:25:05.201
Its okay, just say it.


02:25:12.482 --> 02:25:15.318
If I get out alive,
III go to London...


02:25:15.318 --> 02:25:17.047
and tell Natasha that...


02:25:26.863 --> 02:25:28.262
Say what? Just say it!


02:25:28.531 --> 02:25:29.759
Come on, Kabir!


02:25:33.737 --> 02:25:35.637
- Come on, Kabir!
- Come on!


02:25:35.705 --> 02:25:38.299
<i>I'm sorry but I can't marry you.</i>


02:25:40.510 --> 02:25:41.175
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:25:41.176 --> 02:25:42.405
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:28:24.974 --> 02:28:27.677
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:27.677 --> 02:28:29.736
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:29.812 --> 02:28:32.372
<i>If you're carrying</i>
the lightning of dreams in your eyes.


02:28:32.448 --> 02:28:33.642
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:34.951 --> 02:28:37.943
<i>Like a gust of wind</i>,
learn to live free.


02:28:38.621 --> 02:28:41.590
<i>Learn to flow like</i>
the waves that make a sea.


02:28:42.225 --> 02:28:45.353
<i>Let your arms be wide open</i>,
to every moment you meet.


02:28:46.062 --> 02:28:49.554
<i>May every moment gift you</i>
a new sight to greet.


02:28:50.166 --> 02:28:52.566
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your wonder in your eyes.


02:28:52.635 --> 02:28:54.500
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:55.204 --> 02:28:58.298
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:59.309 --> 02:29:00.435
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:10.853 --> 02:29:10.887
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:10.888 --> 02:29:14.724
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:14.724 --> 02:29:18.455
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:18.528 --> 02:29:22.430
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:22.498 --> 02:29:26.161
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:26.302 --> 02:29:30.139
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:30.139 --> 02:29:33.506
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:42.318 --> 02:29:46.687
<i>Just when the heart</i>
started moving to another beat.


02:29:49.993 --> 02:29:54.453
<i>Out of nowhere</i>
a new thought found its feet.


02:29:57.533 --> 02:30:01.370
<i>That life gives you just one shot.</i>


02:30:01.371 --> 02:30:05.041
<i>So why not love it with all you've got.</i>


02:30:05.041 --> 02:30:08.909
<i>Who knows what we're waiting for</i>


02:30:08.978 --> 02:30:13.210
<i>'Cause life is here and life is now.</i>


02:30:16.886 --> 02:30:21.914
<i>What was only a desire till yesterday.</i>


02:30:24.660 --> 02:30:28.960
<i>Is exactly what we've found today.</i>


02:30:32.035 --> 02:30:35.027
<i>Hand in hand let's always be.</i>


02:30:35.872 --> 02:30:39.000
<i>As we wander through our destiny.</i>


02:30:39.609 --> 02:30:43.279
<i>And all day and all night.</i>


02:30:43.279 --> 02:30:48.307
<i>Happiness rains down on</i>
everything in sight.


02:30:50.520 --> 02:30:54.557
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:30:54.557 --> 02:30:58.288
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:30:58.361 --> 02:31:02.198
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:31:02.198 --> 02:31:06.362
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:22.285 --> 02:31:25.118
<i>If it can knit a new dream everyday.</i>


02:31:26.122 --> 02:31:28.989
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:29.892 --> 02:31:32.725
<i>If it can lead you down a brand new way.</i>


02:31:33.796 --> 02:31:36.594
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:37.333 --> 02:31:40.234
<i>If it can flirt and fly</i>,
If it can spin and jive.


02:31:40.303 --> 02:31:47.770
<i>Then you can call it a life</i>

